<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo injili ilhepieye ni Nayohana phi imoka yo ichitabu ncheshe nhina Malhehano o Naanano anohimiacha ukumi ni makhalhelho a Yesu Kuristo. Kila imoka yo chechiyo ncheshe chiyo ineehaniya “injili,” maana aya akhalhaka “malhove orera.” Chaalhepiye ni Namatayo, Namako, ashinna Luka ni Nayohana baada yo ukhwa wa Yesu. Ikitabu yo injili i Nayohana yaalhepiye veekinaka ni owiittucha Nayohana vaatameria iyaakha yo 90 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, ikitabu iyo khinaahimiacha Nayohana wiira phi lhepilhe, uno iphiro ilhepiye aya ilhikaanaka chinene ni iwarakha yo upacha i Nayohana, iwarakha yo nayelhi i Nayohana ni iwarakha yo neraru i Nayohana. Attu o ulhepa akina o khalhayi anaahimiacha Nayohana wiira aakhalha iwani yo Uefeso yeyo ikatema iyo. Paahi etu ilhikaanaka wiira ilha ikitabu ilha yaalhepiye Uefeso. Nayohana anoohimiacha mwaari nlhatu uri nkitabuni wiira yaakavihe attu arumelhelhe wiira Yesu phi Kuristo, Mwaana a Nlhuku nkumi (nlhako wo 20:31). Wo urumelhelha nenno nlhove nno nipatte ukumi wo nchina nawe. Ikitabu ilha yaalhepiye irwee yashomiye ni onkhaye Ayahudi ni ahiri Ayahudi. Injili i Nayohana wo iphiro chikina khinolhikaana ni injili chikina ttaaru chiyo. Nayohana anoweha chinene mwaha wo cho ushangiha chaapannge awe Yesu, ahihimiachaka chinene mwaha wo malhikaaniho eettuchiha awe Yesu. Chittu chikina chulhupalhe thoko ubatiiziya wa Yesu ni ulhikachiya uthakoni khachinohimiachiya nhina injili ilha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Nayohana anoochokholha injili (nlhako wo 1:1-18:2).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho anoolhepa mwaha unaacha cho ushangiha chaapangilhe awe Yesu (nlhako wo 1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anoohiamcha miaha chinchi chinoholhelha nookhwa ni uhihimmwa wawe (nlhako wo 13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Nayohana anomalhiha injili aya wo uhimiacha ikatema imoka Yesu vaakhumelhenlhe awe attu baada yo uhihimmwa wawe ni uhimiacha nnikwa aya wo uchokholha ulhepa injili ilha (nlhako wo 21).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhove ninowiiha ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Vaachokhonlhe aya chittu chonkhaye chihinoopiya, Nlhove ahaawo, ni uyo aari ni Nlhuku, ni uyo aari Nlhuku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Toka vaachokhonlhe aya Nlhove aari vamoka ni Nlhuku. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nlhuku voopilhe awe chittu chonkhaye ahaawo, khiiwo iriyoothe yoopiye wo uhikhalha yoyo <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nlhove phi aari machokholhelho o ukumi ni uyo ukumi uyo nkawaawiha nthuko wa attu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nthuko waamwalhelha mwiipiphini, ni ipiphi khayoonrie utipiha yoyo nthuko uyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nlhuku ahonruma karumiya awe, eehaniya Yohana, <verse number="7" style="v"/>aawilhe uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha wo yoyo nthuko uyo, attu eewe ni urumelhelha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nayohana khayaari yoyo nthuko uyo, nansho aawilhe uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha wo yoyo nthuko uyo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yolha phi nthuko we ikekhiaye, nthuko unowa velhaponi ni wamwalhelha attu onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nlhove ahaawo velhaponi, ni wo iphiro awe ilhapo yahoopiya, inakhalhaka chiicho, attu o velhaponi khayanchuwenlhe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aawilhe velhaponi vawe mwanene, nansho attu awawe khayampochenre. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akina, nansho, yampochenre ni unrumelhelha, yayo ahaavaha ikuru yo ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku phi alhe arumelhenlhe nchina nawe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ahikhalhaka ashaana a Nlhuku wo iphiro thoko cho uyariya ni ntu, mena mattunelho a ntu, Nlhuku mwanene phi ari athumwanaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yoyo Nlhove uyo nkaakhalha ntu, nkaakhalha uwanihu. Ni hii nahoona nthimicho wawe, nthimicho wawe yoyo ri Mwaana o vekhawe a Nlhuku chanre nnema ni ikeekhene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaahimiechesha wa attu mwaha wawe. Nkayaakhuwelha eeraka, “Yolha phi ulhe kanhimianche aka venre aka wiira, ‘Noowa ntu mmoka vatulhi waka, ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii, ukhalhawaya ahaawo kihinayariaa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wo nnema wawe mwinchi, hiyaano onkhaye nihopochera mpuha umpwaha mpuha uvinre. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nlhuku ahonivaha Malhehero wo iphiro ya ashinna Musa, nansho nnema ni ikeekhene chihoniweelha wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu mwonne Nlhuku ikatema iriyoothe. Mwaana vekha awe, aakhalha vamoka ni Nlhuku, phi nichuwelhinhe Athithi.</para>
  <para style="s">Nttenga u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wu phi uhimiechesha u Nayohana, ikatema aholhelhi a Ayahudi o Yerusalemu vaarumme aya opochera ishaani ni Alawi u Nayohana yaakohe wiira, “Inyuva phi apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nayohana khakhonte waakhulha, nkayeera wo uhivitha wiira, “Miyaano kakihena Kuristo Moopolhi a attu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayaakohiya tho, “Inyuva phi apani etu? Chani inyuva phi Naeliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nayohana nkaakhulha, “Akihena mii.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakohiya tho, “Chani inyuva phi anamilhohi alhe anowehereriya uwa uuromolhani nihuku no uwa Masiya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkaakhulha “Akihena mii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nkayaakohiya tho, “Paahi etu inyuva phi apani? Nnihimerieke mwaanene nlhove nowahimeria anirumme.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nayohana nkaakhulha, “Miyaano phi yolhe anamilhohi ashinna Isaya aahimmie aya yeeraka,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nlhove na ntu niheewaniya muuthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q">Chookolhiye iphiro cho uvira Athithi!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yayo akarumiya yaarumiye ni nlhoko wa Amafarisayo ayo, <verse number="25" style="v"/>nkayaakoha Nayohana, “Yakhalhaka inyuva kanhena Kuristo, kanhena Naeliya ni vavawo kanhena anamilhohi, woonaka nnowaabatiiza attu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Miyaano kinaabatiiza attu wo maashi, nansho hawo mmoka eemenlhe munlhokoni mwinyu mwaattiva nhinaaya unchuwelha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yoyo nowa utulhi waka, nansho mii kihiphwanelhiyaka inakhalhaka uthaphulha miripwe cho ikwakwata chawe.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">Ikwakwata nnyaani mwa ntu</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yoyo mwaha uyo waakhumelhenlhe Ubethaniya, unosha nchuwa ukhopelhelhe mwolhoko wo Uyorodani, Nayohana vaari aya aabatiizaka attu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu, Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya, Nayohana ahomwoona Yesu awaaka, nkayeera, “Ulha phi Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku nothamiha uwonya wa attu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yolha phi ulhe kanhimianche aka wiira, ‘Utulhi waka nowa ntu mmoka ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii, ukhalhawaya ahaawo mii kihinayariaa.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Miyaano kimwanene akanchuwenlhe, nansho kiwiilhe uwabatiiza attu wo maashi ikhalhe wiira attu o Uisraeli anchuwelhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaahimiechesha eeraka, “Kahomwoona Iphumu ya Nlhuku akhuruwaka thoko kaulha ukhuma wiirimu ni ukorelha vanikhathani vawe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Miyaano akanchuwenlhe, nansho Nlhuku kirumme kaabatiize attu wo maashi ahokihimeria wiira, ‘Ulhe ntu nnohalha inyu umwoona akhuruwelhiyaka ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni unkorelha vanikhathani vawe, yoyo phi ntu naabatiiza attu wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayeera, kihoona, ni mii kihimiecheshe vano wiira yolha phi Mwaana a Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Owiittucha o upacha a Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya, Nayohana aari vavawo tho vamoka ni owiittucha aya elhi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vaamwonne aya Yesu aviraka nkayeera, “Mmwooneke! Ulha phi Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Owiittucha aheewa Nayohana voolhumacha aya yayo malhove ayo, nkayanttwaracha Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarukunuwa, nkoona owiittucha a Nayohana anttwaraka, nkaakoha, “Nnaaviani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni ayo nkayaakhulhacha “Rabi, nnokhalha vayi?” Rabi maana aya, “Owiittuchiha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mmweeke ni inyu nnowoona.” Vavawo waari uchechilho, paahi etu owiittucha ayo nkayaarwaa nkayoona vaakhalha awe, nkayankhalhana uwannyawe nenno nihuku nno.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Naandorea ahima aya Nasimoni Peturo yaari amoka ya attu elhi yeewilhe Nayohana voolhumacha aya, nkayanttwara Yesu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vahiphincheru Naandorea nkayaakumaana Nasimoni ahima aya, nkayaahimeria wiira, “Nihomwoona Masiya.” Masiya maana aya Kuristo, Moopolhi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nkayaavelhelha Nasimoni wa Yesu,</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaaweha Nasimoni nkeera, “Inyuva phi Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana, nansho vano nnohalha wiihaniya Kefa.” Ukhalhawaya we Iyunani nenno nchina nno phi Peturo maana aya mwalha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweehana Nafilipo ni Nanathanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya Yesu nkoona mbaya arwee Ugalilaya. Nkaaphwanya Nafilipo nkeerelha, “Nkittware!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nafilipo aari anenchi o Ubethsaida, iwani yaakhalha aya Naandorea ni Napeturo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nafilipo ni ayo nkaaphwanya Nanathanieli, nkaahimeria, “Nihomwoona ulhe ashinna Musa anromonlhe aya nhina ikitabu yo Malhehero, ni anamilhohi alhepaka nttenga wawe. Yoyo phi Yesu mwaana a Nayusufu, o Unazareti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nanathanieli nkayaakoha Nafilipo, “Ittu yoombone inowooria ukhuma Unazareti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nafilipo nkayaakhulha, “Mmwe mwoona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu vonne aya Nanathanieli awaaka nkeera, “Mmwooneke! Yolha phi Mwiisraeli mwanenene, khiiwo ittu innananre nhina mwawe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nanathanieli nkayankoha, “Nkichuwenlhe chani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vaari inyu wuthi nkhuyu Nafilipo ahinaya uwihanani kahowoonani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Vavawo Nanathanieli nkayaamwakhulha Yesu eeraka, “Owiittuchiha, inyuva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku! Inyuva phi Amwene o Uisraeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani nnorumelhelha ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani wiira kahowoonani vaari inyu wuthi nkhuyu? Nnowa mwoona moolhupalhe upwaha alha!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria onkhaye wiira, “Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, nnowoona irimu chihulhiaka ni minepa cha Nlhuku chiwelhaka ni ukhuruwa vachulhu vawe Mwaana a Ntu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Arusi Ukaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku no neraru ahokhalha arusi iwani yo Ukaana, ilhapo yo Ugalilaya, anumwanawe Yesu aari wowo, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ni Yesu aholhalheiya vamoka ni owiittucha awe wa arusini uwo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Idivai yamalheke, anumwanawe nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Idivai ihomalha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Maanyi, nlhatu waani nnokiirelha chiicho. Ikatema aka khinaaya.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Anumwane Yesu aheerelha akarumiya, “Ittu iriyoothe inohalha awe uhimeriani mpangeke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ayahudi ahanaa malhemalhelho o ukhucha. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, chahokhalha vavawo miapu cho malhuku nthanu ni mmoka. Ni kila mwaapu mmoka waahelhiya maashi wo umalhaka madumu makani makhumi melhi ama makhumi mararu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha akarumiya, “Nchariheke maashi mmiapuni mmo.” Ni ayo nkayaacharihacha maashi mpaka nchulhu tetetete. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha akarumiya, “Vano nrikeke ni waarwehelha nankawa.” Nkayaarika ni waarwehelha nankawa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>maashi yaathathuwilhe vano ukhalha idivai, ni ayo nkayaalhawiha. Nansho khayaachuwenlhe wiira ikhumme uyi. Nansho akarumiya alhe yaari achuwelhaka ukhumelhenlhe aya. Nankawa nkeehana abwana arusi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nkoolhumacha eerelhaka, “Attu onkhaye ampachera thoko ukawa idivai yo uchiva, yamalhaka phi nokawa aya idivai yooririya. Nansho inyuva nhoshunga idivai yo uchiva mpaka nna!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu aapannge yeyo yo ushangiha yo uchokholha iyo Ukaana ilhapo yo Ugalilaya, wowo nkooniha nthimicho wawe, ni owiittucha awe nkayanrumelhelha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Arusi amalheke, Yesu ni anumwanawe vamoka ni ashihimawe ni owiittucha awe, nkayaarwaa Ukapenaumu ni ukhalha wowo wo mahuku vakani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorwaa unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mako 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isikuukuu yo Pasaka ya Ayahudi yaari inaatamenrie, paahi etu Yesu nkarwaa Uyerusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wowo, u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaaphwanya attu athumihaka ing'ope, ikhondoro, ni ikhunda, ni attu o wakakaniha nchurukhu anari anakhanlhanche mmamezani mwaya aakakhanihaka nchurukhu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Ntu o waakakhaniha nchurukhu</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkaakorosha ikopo yo nttondoro, nkoomolhacha ashinama onkhaye vathe, ikhondoro vamoka ni ing'ope, nkaapitikulhacha imeza chaya, ni umwarushacha nchurukhu u Inupa ya Nlhuku mmo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>nkeerelha alhe aathumiha ikhunda alhe wiira, “Nthamihache chilha chittu chilha vaa! Nhipange inupa ya Athumwanaka ukhalha nipuro no upangelha maronda!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkoopuwelha iholhepiya nhina Malhove Matakatifu wiira, “Uttuna waka inupa inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku unokiiva, ukipahaka thoko mooro.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Aholhelhi a Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha Yesu wo unkoha, “Nnaapangeke cho ushangiha chaani wooniha wiira nhanaa ikuru yo upangacha yoyo mwaha uyo?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkaphomolhani ilha inupa ya Nlhuku ilha, ni mii kinotheka tho wo mahuku mararu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vavawo Ayahudi nkayeera, “Ilha inupa ya Nlhuku ilha, yaathekiye wo umalhaka iyaakha makhumi ncheshe ni sita, chani, inyuva nnottuna utheka chani wo mahuku mararu?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho inupa yaarerihelha awe Yesu yaari iruttu awe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paahi etu vaahihimushiye awe ukhuma nnookhwani, owiittucha awe ahoopuwelha wiira aholhohera yayo, nkayaarumelhelha Malhove Matakatifu, yaahimianche awe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noochuwelha mirima cha attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe Uyerusalemu wo isikuukuu yo Pasaka, attu enchi yahorumelhelha nchina nawe yooneke cho ushangiha cheera awe wo uhimiechesha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu khaari ni nrima ni ayo ukhalhawaya ahaachuwelhacha onkhaye. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Khaarina nlhatu wo uhimiechesha uriyoothe, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha rata chene chittu chonkhaye chiri munrimani mwaya.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Nanikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ahaawo nholhelhi mmoka Ayahudi, o mphingo wa Amafarisayo, eehaniya Nanikodemo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Nanikodemo nkayaanrwelha Yesu uhiyu, ni umwiirelha, “Rabi, nihochuwelha wiira inyuva phi Owiittuchiha nrumiye ni Nlhuku. Khaawo ntu nooria upanga cho ushangiha chinopangacha inyu Nlhuku ahikhalheke vamoka ni uyo.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu khanooria woona Umwene wa Nlhuku ahiyarieke tho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nanikodemo nkayaakoha, “Ntu nkumi noorieke chani ukelha munthunkwani mwa anumwanawe, ni uyariya wo nayelhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu ahiyarieke wo maashi ni wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, ata veeriye chani khanooria ukelha Imwene ya Nlhuku. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ntu noyaria wo iruttu wa athumwanawe ni anumwanawe, nansho noyaria munnepani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nhishange ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani wiira ihophwanelhiya mwaattiva onkhaye vaa uyaria wo nayelhi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iphioo inowuka ni ukelha unothanana aya, nnowiiwa vanowuka aya, nansho khannochuwelha unokhumelhelha aya mena unokelhelha aya. Phiri aya thoko ntu yarelhe wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nanikodemo nkayankoha Yesu, “Yoyo mwaha uyo unoorieke chani?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, inyuva ngati phi owiittuchiha attu o Uisraeli nhichuwelhe yoyo mwaha uyo? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, hiyaano ninohimiacha ichuwenlhe ihu ni uhimiechesha yonne ihu, nansho mwaattiva khannorumelhelha nttenga wihu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akhalhaka kihouhimeriani mwaha wo velhaponi ni inyu khannokirumelhelha, nnorieke chani urumelhelha koohimeriakani mwaha wo wiirimu? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu aapanche urwaa uchulhu wiirimu ahikhalhe Mwaana a Ntu, aakhuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Thoko ashinna Musa vaatheshilhe aya nchulhu inwaa yo shaba vamwirini uthakoni ulhe, ni uyo Mwaana a Ntu nootheshiya nchulhu chiichammo, <verse number="15" style="v"/>wiira kila ntu nonrumelhelha akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nlhuku ahaattuna attu o velhaponi chinene, wo chiichammo etu, nkankhumiha Mwaana awe o yekha, riyoothe nonrumelhelha hipotere, nansho akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nlhuku khaanrumme Mwaana awe velhaponi awe aahukumulha attu, nansho oopolhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Attu onkhaye anonrumelhelha Mwaana khanohukumulhiya, ahinonrumelhelha ahomalha uhukumulhiya, ukhalhawaya kharumelhenlhe nchina no Mwaana a Nlhuku o yekha awe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ni ihukumu ene phi ilha, nthuko uhowa velhaponi, nansho attu anothanana ipiphi ahittunaka nthuko, ukhalhawaya chittu chinopangacha aya chiri cho uhilhoka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Attu anopanga cho uhilhoka unowarusha nthuko ni ayo khanowa voonene, ukhalhawaya khanottuniha cho uhilhoka chaya chimwalhelhiye. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho anovarechesha ikeekhene anoowa unthukoni, mitheko chaya chiwe chooniya chipangiaka wo unthimicha Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkarwaa ilhapo yo Uyudea vamoka ni owiittucha awe, nkakhalhana wowo vamoka, ni attu aawa nkaabatiiziya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nayohana chiicho aari aabatiizaka attu Uainoni, iwani yaatameria Usalimu, ukhalhawaya wowo ahokhalha maashi menchi. Attu nkayanrweelha, ni ayo nkaabatiizacha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayohana aari ahinaya uttukiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Owiittucha akina a Nayohana nkayaakhulhana ni Nyahudi mmoka wo mwaha wo malhemalhelho o khucha ikatema yo unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Paahi etu, owiittucha ayo nkayaarwelha Nayohana ni weerelha, “Owiittuchiha, nnomuupuwelha yolhe ntu arina inyu vamoka ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni inyuva nkamwanhimiechesha ulhe? Vano ni uyo nobatiiza, ni attu onkhaye anonrweelha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Ntu khanoria ukhalha ni ittu aahivahiyeke ni Nlhuku o wiirimu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaashinene nnoworia uhimiechesha wiira kahohimia, ‘Miyaano kakihena Kuristo, nansho kirumiye wiira kinholhelhe!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>A bibi arusi phi awaya abwana arusi, nansho anlhoko aya abwana arusi, aneemelha ni wiiwelhelha, anoshangarara chinene vaneewa aya abwana arusi yuulhumachaka. Phi chiicho ni mii ushangarara waka vanotimirihiya aya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yoyo phi phwanenlhe athepe ukhalha ochuwania chinene, ni miyaano kiwukuwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nowa ukhuma wiirimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nowa ukhuma uchulhu phi mulhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye. Nokhuma velhaponi phi o ilhapo, olhumachaka mwaha wo velhaponi, nansho nowa ukhuma wiirimu phi mulhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yoyo yonne awe ni wiiwa ayo, phi o uhimiechesha, nansho khaawo ntu nottuna nttenga awe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nansho ntu riyoothe nottuna nttenga awe nohimiechesha wiira Nlhuku phi nohimiechesha ikeekhene. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ulhe rumiye ni Nlhuku nohimiacha malhove a Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nommaha yoyo ntu uyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku wo uhikhalha maphimelho. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Athithi anonttuna Mwaana ni ummaha ikuru chonkhaye mmathathani mwawe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Attu anonrumelhelha Mwaana ahanaa ukumi wo uhimalha, attu ahinomwiiwelhelha Mwaana khanokhalha ni ukumi wo uhimalha, nansho anohalha muurushiyani mwa Nlhuku.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaareriha ni Nsamariya nthiyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayeewa wiira Yesu nowaapatta owiittucha enchi ni wabatiiza waapwaha Nayohana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu mwanene khambatinze ntu, nansho owiittucha awe phi abatiiza attu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu veewilhe awe mwaha wolhumachiya, nkaathama Uyudea nkaahokolhia Ugalilaya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vaari awe munkwahani mmo, nkaavirelha iwani yo Usamariya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wowo Usamariya uwo nkaaphiya Usukari, iwani yaatamenrie imata i Nayakhobo yaavanhe aya anaya, Nayusufu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ilhushi i Nayakhobo yaari vavawo. Yeyo ikatema iyo yaari uthana variyari, ni Yesu aari noochelhe wo nkwaha, nkeettuwa vachereshere ilhushi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nthiyana mmoka Nsamariya nkaawa urikani maashi, Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Nkivahe maashi kiwurie.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, owiittucha awe yaari anakelhanche umawani uuthumani yolhia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nansho yoyo nthiyana uyo nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Inyuva mwa Ayahudi, miyaano ki Nsamariya, nnooria chani ukivekelha mii maashi o wuria?” Olhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya Ayahudi khayaari yaathanaka ni Asamariya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, ikaari nchuwelhaka izawadi ya Nlhuku inothanana awe uuvahani, ni unchuwelha mpani nowiirelhani, “ ‘Nkivahe maashi kiurie’ mwaanonvekelha ni uyo anouvahani maashi anowiiha ukumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yoyo nthiyana uyo nkeera, “Pwiiya, inyuva khanrina indowo yo urikelha maashi ni ilhushi ene inarekamme. Nnaapatteke vayi maashi ari ni ukumi? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Athumwanihu Nayakhobo ni achishaana aya ni mihuwo chaya yaawuriacha vava.” Chani etu woonaka nneepanga ukhalha olhupalhe waapwaha yayo Nayakhobo ayo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Onkhaye anowuria alha maashi alha anowolhiya nttona tho, <verse number="14" style="v"/>nansho ntu nohalha uwuria maashi anohalha aka ummaha mii, khanowolhiya nttona tho. Wo ikekhiaye, maashi anohalha aka ummaha, anowa ukhalha nrapo ninothekhuma maashi anowiiha ukumi. Ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yoyo nthiyana uyo nkeera, “Pwiiya, nkakivaheni yayo maashi ayo! Kihoone nttona tho, mena kihiwe tho uurikani maashi vaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Nrwee mweehane owannyu mwaawane vaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nthiyana uyo nkaakhulha “Miyaano khakirina alhopwana,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeera, “Nhohimia ikekhiaye wiira khanrina alhopwana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mwahothelhiya ni manyaalhopwana athanu, ni ayo nnaakhalhana inyu vano ayo kahena owaninyu. Vavawo nhohimia ikekhiaye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nthiyana uyo nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Pwiiya, kinoona wiira inyuva phi anamilhohi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Manyaapwiiya ihu yanthimicha Nlhuku vachulhu ulha mwaako ulha, nansho mwaattiva Ayahudi va nnoniirelha wiira nipuro no nthimicha Nlhuku phi Uyerusalemu ulhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Maanyi nkirumelhelheke etu, mahuku anowa vahinowa inyu waathimicha Athithi vachulhu ulha mwaako ulha, mena Uyerusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwaattiva Asamariya va nnonthimicha ulhe nhinonchuwelha inyu. Nansho hii Ayahudi va ninonchuwelha ninonthimicha ihu, ukhalhawaya woopolhiya unchokholhelha wa Ayahudi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho mahuku anoowa ni ayo ahomalha uphiya, wo ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, attu anowa waathimicha Athithi wo ikeekhene, ni waathimicha wo iphiro ye ikeekhene inothanana aya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nlhuku phi Iphumu. Chiichammo etu, attu anonthimicha anthananiya anthimicheke wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni ikeekhene thoko chiri awe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nthiyana uyo nkaahimia, “Kihochuwelha wiira Kuristo Moopolhi noowa. Vanohalha awe uwa, nonichuwelhiha chittu chonkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mii kinoolhumacha ni inyuva va, phi Yoyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo owiittucha awe Yesu nkayaahokolhiacha, nkayaashangacha chinene umwoona aarerihaka ni nthiyana. Nansho khaawo ntu ankonhe nthiyana ulhe, “Nnothananani?” Ama unkoha Yesu, “Nnaarerihani ni alha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Paahi etu nthiyana uyo nkaahiya mwaapu awe, nkaarwa umawani u waahimeriani attu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Nkawaani mmwe mwaamona ntu kihimenrie mwaha kipangilhe aka wonkhaye. Chani khinooria wiira yoyo phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Attu nkayaathamacha mmawani nkayaarwaa uumwonani Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo owiittucha awe yaari ampepechaka amwirelhaka, “Owiittuchiha, nlhieke yolhia!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeerelha, “Miyaano kihanaa yolhia nhinochuwelha inyu mwaattiva.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayaakohanacha ashineneru, “Chani hawo ntu ammwinhenre yolhia?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Yolhia yaangu iri phi uvara mitheko chaya alhe akirumme ni utimiriha chinothanana aya. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nneera, ‘Chihohalha mieri micheshe, nlhaalha uphiye.’ Nansho miyaano kinouhimeriani wiira, mmweheke mmamatani chinre aya, cholhia chihaaya wo ukhunguriya! <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ntu o ukhungura noolhiviya mahalha awe, athokoreriaka cholhia wo nlhatu no ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. Chiichammo etu ntu naalha ni ntu nokhungura anowa aashangarara vamoka. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu nna nulhumo nna phi ikeekhene, ‘Mmoka phi naalha ni nkina nokhungura.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Miyaano kuurummeni wiira mwakhungure cholhia mmamatani mwahaalhimme inyu, akina phi alhimme, nansho mwaattiva nnopuha wo ntukutta naya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Attu enchi o Usamariya yahonrumelhelha Yesu wo malhove aahimiechesha awe yoyo nthiyana uyo wiira, “Hokihimeria mwaha wonkhaye waapanga aka.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Attu o Usamariya nkayanrwelha Yesu, nkayanlhepelha wiira akhalhe vavawo. Nkaalhokelha wowo wo mahuku melhi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Attu enchi akina nkayaarumelhelha nttenga wa Yesu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>nkayerelha athiyana alhe wiira, “Vano hii ninorumelhelha kuhiwe wo nlhatu no malhove inyu. Nansho niheewa naashinene, ni uchuwelha wiira we ikeekhene yolha ntu ulha phi Moopolhi o ilhapo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha mwaana a nholhelhi mmoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Avireke mahuku melhi, Yesu nkaathama wowo, nkaarwa Ugalilaya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesu aarwaa mwanene ukhalhawaya ahohimiechesha wiira, “Namilhohi khanothimichiya uwannyawe.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Aphiyeke Ugalilaya, attu yahompochera, ukhalhawaya ni ayo yaari Uyerusalemu uwo unlhiani Pasaka. Nkayoona chittu chonkhaye chaapanganche awe ikatema yo Pasaka iyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahokolhia tho Ukaana ilhapo yo Ugalilaya waathathunshe awe maashi ukhalha idivai. Wowo ahaawo nholhelhi mmoka upuwani u Naherode, aari ni mwaana mmirawo nreta iwani yo Ukapenaumu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yoyo veewilhe awe wiira Yesu howa Ugalilaya ukhuma Uyudea, nkanrwelha ni unlhepelha wiira anttukane Ukapernaumu anlhamihe mwaana awe mmirawo aari nreta chinene. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Khaawo ntu nohalha urumelhelha aahoneke ithikineha ni cho ushangiha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yoyo nholhelhi uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, shontee, nngwee mwaana aka hinakhwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nrweeke etu, mwaana inyu noolhama!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yoyo ntu uyo nkaarumelhelha malhove a Yesu nkaarwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Vaari awe mphironi ahokolhiaka uwani, akarumiya awe nkayaawa ni unhimeria wiira, “Mwammirawo inyu nreta uyo holhama!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nkaakoherera ikatema ureta vanhiilhe aya mwaana, ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Nchana uthana, ureta phi nhiyalhe aya.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Paahi etu athumwane mwaana ayo nkayoopuwelha wiira, yaari yelhe ikatema yaahimiye ni Yesu ilhe venre awe, “Mwaana inyu noolhama.” Vavawo etu yayo vamoka ni alhoko aya onkhaye, nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ilha yaari yo ushangiha yo nayelhi yaapannge awe Yesu vaari awe akhumaka Uyudea alhukamaka Ugalilaya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ulhamihiya ntu vanthapwini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umalha wo yayo, Yesu nkaarwa Uyerusalemu wo isikuukuu ya Ayahudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wowo Uyerusalemu uwo vanaatameria nlhako uneehaniya Nlhako wo Khondoro nihawo nthapwi nineehaniya wo Iebraniya Betizata, nthotho mwaya nikhalhaka ni ipwaro nthanu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Areta enchi yaari akhalhachaka mmapwaroni mmo, attu ohoona, oremara ni attu oririyacha iruttu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yayo areta ayo yaari awehereraka wiira nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi ukhuruwe uwa ututuwanyihani maashi. Nreta aaholhelha ukhelha munthapwini vanotutuwanyihiya aya maashi uyo, aholhama ikwerere iriyoothe yaarina awe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paahi ahaawo ntu mmoka vavawo awereiya ikwerere yo uririyacha iruttu iyaakha makhumi mararu ni nane. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ahomwoona yoyo ntu uyo narumpe vavawo, nkaachuwelha wiira hokhalha vavawo wo iyaakha chinchi, nkankoha, “Chani, nnoothanana ulhama?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nreta uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, khakirina ntu o ukitumbucheriha munthapwini vanotutuwanihiya aya maashi, kila vanolhikacha aka ukelha mmaashini, ntu nkina nookiholhelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwiirelha ntu o uririyacha iruttu ulhe, “Wunkweke etu, ukusheke nttato nao nno weeteke, urweeke.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wo uhipicha yoyo ntu uyo nkaalhama, nkaakusha nttato nawe, nkeeta.</para>
  <para style="p">Nihuku naapangelhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo, naari Nihuku no Wiittuwa, <verse number="10" style="v"/>wo chiichammo etu aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayaamwiirelha ntu aalhamihiye ulhe, “Lhelho Nihuku no Wiittuwa, Malhehero ihu anoochiichiha wiira khavanooria ukusha nttato ninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ntu ulhe nkaakhulha eeraka, “Yoyo ntu kilhaminhe uyo phi kiirenlhe, ‘Ukusheke nttato nao, weeteke, urweeke.’ ” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayankoha, “Phi mpani o wirenlheni nkusheke ntatto ninyu mweeteke, nrweeke?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho aalhamihiye uyo khanchuwenlhe Yesu, ukhalhawaya wo nlhatu no uchara attu chinene, Yesu ahomalha ummwia nyerere. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Miholho aya, Yesu nkamphwanya ntu anlhaminhe awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku ulhe, nkeera, “Nholhama vano, nhiwonye tho, nhiwe mwaapatta yo hilhoka chinene.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yoyo ntu uyo nkaarwa wa aholhelhi a Ayahudi ni waahimeria wiira Yesu phi nlhaminhe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi etu Ayahudi nkayaachokholhacha umvenga Yesu, wo nlhatu no nlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha eeraka, “Athumwanaka arii munthekoni, phi chiichammo ni mii kihophwanelhiya upanga mitheko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nenno nlhove nno etu, nkanaathepiha aholhelhi a Ayahudi waavia iphiro yo mwiiva Yesu, kuhena wo nlhatu nohithimicha Malhehero yo Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Nansho ukhalhawaya aahowulhumacha wiira Nlhuku phi Athumwanawe, ni wilhikaaniha ni Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s">Ikuru yo Mwaana a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha Ayahudi eeraka, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Mwaana khanooria upanga ittu mwanene, nopanga ilhe noona awe Athumwanawe apangaka. Inopanga aya Athumwanawe, Mwaana phi nopanga awe chiicho. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Athithi anonttuna Mwaana, ni umwooniha chittu chonkhaye chinopanga aya anene, amwoonihaka chittu chulhupalhe upwaha chii cho nlhamiha ntu chii, ni inyu nnowa ushanga chinene. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Thoko Athithi chinaahihimusha aya attu akhwilhe ni waavaha ukumi, phi chiichammo etu Mwaana ni uyo nowaavaha ukumi anaattuna awe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Athithi khanonhukumulha ntu riyoothe. Mwaana phi vahiye ikuru yonkhaye yo waahukumulha attu, <verse number="23" style="v"/>yiireke wiira attu onkhaye anthimicheke Mwaana thoko chinaathimicha aya Athithi. Ntu hinonthimicha Mwaana khanaathimicha Athithi anrumme.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, aneewa malhove aka ni waarumelhelha akirumme, anoopatta ukumi wo uhimalha. Yayo khanohukumulhiya, nansho ahomalha uvira nnookhwani ni ukelha mu ukumini mwo uhimalha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, mahuku anowa, ni ayo ahomalha uwa, akhwilhe vanowa aya wiiwacha nlhove na Mwaana a Nlhuku, ni ayo anottuna wiiwa ayo anokhalha akumi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Thoko Athithi chiri aya machokholhelho o ukumi, phi chiichammo etu chinvahe aya Mwaana ukhalha machokholhelho o ukumi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tho ahommaha Mwaana ikuru yo uhukumulha, ukhalhawaya yoyo phi Mwaana a Ntu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nhuumiye uwanoni, mahuku anowa onkhaye ari mmahiyeni vanowa aya wiiwacha nlhove nawe <verse number="29" style="v"/>ni uhihimmwa mmahiyeni. Alhe apangilhe chorera anohihimmwa ni ukhalha akumi, ni alhe aapannge cho uhilhoka anowa uhihimmwa ni uhukumulhiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Miyaano khakinooria upanga ittu wo ikuru aka kimwanene, Kinohukumulha thoko chineeraka wo uhimeriya ni Athithi, ni iyo ihukumu aka phi yo ikekhiaye, ukhalhawaya akinolhikacha upanga ittu kinothanana aka, nansho chinothanana aya akirumme.</para>
  <para style="s">Ikeekhene inohimiechesha ikuru ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Keehimiecheshaka mii kimwanene, uhimiechesha waka khunooria urumelhelhiya wiira we ikeekhene. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho hawo nkina nokihimiechesha mii, ni miyaano kihochuwelha wiira chonkhaye chinohimia awe akiromolhaka phi ikeekhene. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mwahaaruma attu urweeha nttenga wo ukikoherera u Nayohana, ni ayo ahohimiechesha ikeekhene. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Uhimiechesha wa attu kuhii unokhulhuvelha aka, nansho kinohimiacha alha malhove alha wiira mwoopolhiye. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nayohana yaari thoko nthuko waamwalhelha nkwee, ni inyu mwaatti wo mahuku vakani nkamwaattapelhelha yoyo nthuko uyo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nansho miyaano kihanaa malhove kinohimiechesha aka arii molhupalhe upwaha malhove a Nayohana. Ukhalhawaya mitheko kinopanga aka, phi mitheko akivanhe aya Athithi wiira kipange, ni chechiyo phi nokihimiechesha wiira Athithi phi kirumme. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ni ayo Athithi akirumme, phi nokihimiechesha. Mwaattiva khannapacha wiiwa nlhove naya, mena woona ikhove aya, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ni inyu khannarumelhelha nlhove naya munrimani mwinyu, ukhalhawaya nhokhota unrumelhelha nrumme aya. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnooshoma Malhove Matakatifu mwaanyiheraka wiira mwommo, nnoophwanya ukumi wo uhimalha. Nansho yayo Malhove ayo phi nokihimiechesha mii! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka chiicho, mpaka nna mwaattiva khannottuna uwa uwannyaka mmwe mwaapatta ukumi uhinomalha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Nnikwa aka khurii upatta nthimicho unokhuma wa attu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nansho kihoochuwelhani mwaatti wiira, unttuna Nlhuku khuuwo mu nrimani mwinyu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Miyaano kiwiilhe wo ikuru ya Athithi, ni inyu khannakipochera, nansho attu akina yawaaka wo ikuru chaya ashinene, nnowaapochera. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnothanana upochera nthimicho winyu mwaashineneru, nhaaviaka upatta nthimicho ukhuma wa uyo ri vekha, Nlhuku, nnoorieke chani etu ukirumelhelha? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nhaanyihere wiira miyaano phi nowa kaahimiacha milhatu chinyu wa Athithi. Ashinna Musa, mweshenre inyu nikhulhuvelho ninyu, yayo phi nowa uhimiachani milhatu chinyu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yakaari mwahaarumelhelha ashinna Musa, mwaanokirumelhelha ni mii, ukhalhawaya ashinna Musa yaholhepa malhove anokaacha mii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Nansho yakhalhaka wiira khamwaarumelhenlhe Malhehero yaalhepiye ni ashinna Musa, nnoorieke chani urumelhelha malhove aka?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhiha attu maelufu nthanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umalhawaya, Yesu nkaalhapuwa nttiya no Ugalilaya ama nttiya no Utiberiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu nkawanttwara, nlhatu no woona cho ushangiha chaari awe apangaka ni waalhamiha areta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawelha umwaakoni, nkaakhalha vamoka ni owiittucha awe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isikuukuu ya Ayahudi yo Pasaka yaari inaatamenrie. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu apathusheke miitho, nkoona nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu ummweelhaka. Nkaakoha Nafilipo, “Ninaathumeke vayi yolhia yowaalhiha attu alha?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu olhumanche chiicho wo waalhikacha Nafilipo, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha mwanene chowiira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nafilipo nkayaakhulha, “Ninathumaka mikatte cho idinari imia pilhi chirina ihu khachimmwanelha waalhiha inakhalhaka vakani alha attu enchi alha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe mmoka, Naandorea, nhima aya Nasimoni Peturo, nkaamwiirelha, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hawo vaa mmirawo mmoka rina mikatte nthanu cho shayiri ni ihopa pilhi. Nansho khachinowanelha wa attu enchi thoko alha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mwaakalhiheke etu attu ayo vathi.” Manyashi aari menchi vavawo vakittu vawo. Paahi etu attu nkayaakhalha vathi, alhopwana vekha aya aphiyelhaka attu maelufu nthanu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakusha mikatte chilhe, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, nkaakawelha attu yaakhalhanche. Ni ihopa chiyo nkeera chiicho, kila ntu nkaapatta chaathananne awe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Attu vaawonne aya Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Nrokottacheke mikatte chihanlhe chiyo chihipotere.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkayaakhupacha mahalhahalha aahanlhe, nkayaachariha makaya khumi ni melhi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Attu yooneke yeyo yo ushangiha yaapangilhe awe Yesu iyo, nkayeeracha, “Wo ikekhiaye yolha phi namilhohi aaphwanelhiye uwa velhaponi!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachuwelha wiira attu yaari athananaka ummara umwene, nkaathama tho, nkaarwa umwaakoni vekha awe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweeta vachulhu maashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Mat 14:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Waphiyeke uchechilho owiittucha awe nkayaakhuruwa urwaa unttiyani, <verse number="17" style="v"/>nkayaawelhacha nkalhavani, alhapuwaka urwaa Ukapenaumu. Ipiphi yaari inakenlhe, ni Yesu aari hinaapiyelha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nttiya nkanaachokholha ututuwana nlhatu no iphioo yaawuka wo machiri. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Owiittucha vaaphilhe aya nkwaha wo maili nthanu ama sita, nkayaamoona Yesu eetaka vachulhu maashi, aatameriaka ikalhava, nkayoovacha chinene. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Phi mii, nhoovache!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nkayaathanana unkusha Yesu nkalhavani, ni ikalhava yaari inaphiilhe ukhopelhelhe nttiya waalhukama aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Attu anoomwaavia Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya nlhoko wa attu yaahanlhe ukhopelhelhe nttiya nkawaachuwelha wiira ikalhava ikina yaahanlhe wowo. Ni ayo nkayoopuwelha wiira Yesu khaawenlhe nkalhavani vamoka ni owiittucha awe, owiittucha ayo yaarwachilhe vekha aya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tho, ikalhava chikina ukhuma Utiberiya chahowa vavawo vakittu vawo attu vaalhilhie aya mikatte, Athithi vaamanlhe aya unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Attu ayo yachuwelheke wiira Yesu ni owiittucha awe khayariwo vavawo, nkayaawelhacha nkalhavani nkayaarwaa umwaaviani Ukapenaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu phi nkatte wo ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkayamphwanya Yesu ukhopelhelhe nttiya nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, mwaawiilhe yaakhani vaa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, khannokaavia wo nlhatu no woona yo ushangiha iyo, nansho ukhalhawaya mwaaholhia mikatte chilhe nkamwaawona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nhichenjeukelhe yolhia inochukumana, nchenjeukelheke yolhia ihinochukumana yo ukumi wo uhimalha. Yoyo phi Mwaana a Ntu, ukhalhawaya Athithi, Nlhuku ahonthanlha ni unhimiechesha wiira noowa uvahani yeyo yolhia iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayankohacha, “vano niireke chani etu, ni hii noorie upanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntheko unothanana awe Nlhuku wiira mpange, uri unrumelhelha ntu nrumilhe aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayankoha, “Unohalha upanga yo ushangiha yaani noone nuurumelhelhe? Unohalha upangani? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ashulhupalhe ihu yaholhia yolhia yaakhumme wiirimu yeehaniya imana uuthakhoni ulhe, thoko Malhove Matakatifu vaneera aya wiira, ‘Ahaalhiha nkatte waakhumme wiirimu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ashinna Musa kahiwe ovanheni nkatte wo wiirimu, nansho Athumwanaka phi nouvahani mwaattiva nkatte we ikeekhene unokhuma wiirimu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya nkatte wa Nlhuku nnovahiya inyu phi uyo nokhuruwa ukhuma wiirimu ni uwiiha ukumi wa attu o velhaponi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Paahi nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, nkanivaheni yoyo nkatte uyo mahuku onkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Miyaano phi yolhia inouvahani ukumi. Nokiweelha khanowolhiya ithalha tho, nokirumelhelha khanowolhiya nttona tho. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vano etu, kahouhimeriani wiira nnookona nansho khannokirumelhelha. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe anokivaha aya Athithi nookiweelha, ni mii khakinonkhota ntu nokiweelha, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya khakiwiilhe ukhuma wiirimu kiwe kaapanga chinothanana aka mii, nansho chinothanana aya Athithi akirumme. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ni iyo anothanana aya akirumme iri wiira, kihinrihe hata mmoka akivanhe aya, nansho kiwe kanhihimusha ni ummaha ukumi wo uhimalha nihuku no umalha ilhapo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ittu inothanana aya Athithi phi ilha, attu onkhaye anomwona Mwaana ni unrumelhelha, akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. Ni mii kinowaahihimusha nihuku no umalha ilhapo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayaarushiya, nlhatu Yesu aahowiira, “Miyaano phi nkatte ukhuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nkayeeracha, “Ana ulha ntu ulha kahiwe Yesu, mwaana a Nayusufu? Nihaachuwelha athumwanawe ni anumwanawe. Chani, vano, neera wiira khuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkahiyani uchukulha mwaashineneru. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu nowa uwannyaka aahiwihiyeke ni Athithi akirumme mii, ni mii kinonhihimusha nihuku no umalha ilhapo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Anamilhohi aholhepa wiira, ‘Kila ntu nowiittuchihiya ni Nlhuku.’ Kila ntu neewelhelha Athithi, ni wiittucha uwannyaya yoyo nowa uwannyaka. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kineera wiira, khaawo ntu riyoothe panche woona Athithi, yoyo khumme wa Nlhuku uyo vekha awe phi onne Athithi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, ntu norumelhelha, yoyo hanaa ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mii phi nkatte ummwiha ukumi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Manyaapwiiya inyu aholhia imana uthakoni, nansho yahokhwa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nansho nkatte unowa ukhuma wiirimu phi nolhikaana wiira ntu riyoothe nolhia khanokhwa. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Mii phi nkatte wo ukumi unowa ukhuma wiirimu. Ntu alhiaka yolha nkatte ulha yoyo khanokhwa, nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Ni uyo ukhalhaka iruttu aka, kinokumiha aka wiira ilhapo ihimalhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yoyo mwaha uyo nkawaawiha waakhulhaniya mwa Ayahudi ashineneru. Waari ukohaniyaka, “Noorieke chani ulha ntu ulha univaha iruttu awe nilhie?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, mwaahilhieke iruttu ya Mwaana a Ntu ni uwuria iphome awe, khannopatta ukumi. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Onkhaye anolhia iruttu aka ni uwuria iphome aka ahana ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, ni mii kinowa kaahihimusha muukumini nihuku noomalha ilhapo. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka wiira iruttu aka phi yolhia ye ikeekhene, ni iphome aka etu phi yo wuria ye ikeekhene. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye anolhia iruttu aka ni uwuria iphome aka anookhalha nhina mwaka, ni mii kinookhalha nhina mwaya. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Athithi ari akumi ahokiruma mii, ni mii kinokhalha wo nlhatu waya. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, ntu nokilhia mii noolhama wo nlhatu naka mii. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Vano etu, nkatte unkhuma wiirimu, khunolhikaana ni nkatte waalhilhie aya manyaapwiiya inyu uthakoni. Aholhia nkaakhwa, nansho anolhia ulha nkatte ulha khanokhwa anookhalha akumi mahuku no uhimalha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu olhumanche yayo vaari awe eettuchihaka mu inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku Ukapenaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malhove anowiiha ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe enchi veewilhe aya nkayeera, “Alha meettuchiho alha arii orikarika chinene. Apani anohalha wiiwelhelha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachuwelha ichuku cha owiittucha wo uhihimeriya ni ntu, paahi etu nkeera, “Chani nhokelhiya nipampa? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Inottuna ukhalha chani etu vanowa inyu umoona Mwaana a Ntu arwaaka nchulhu waari awe? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Nnepa wa Nlhuku phi nowiiha ukumi, ikuru cha ntu chihikhalhaka ittu. Malhove kuulhumachilhe aka phi nommwiiha Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowiiha ukumi. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka chiicho ahawo akina inyu ahinokirumelhelha.” Yesu oolhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya ahaachuwelha ahinonrumelhelha ni ntu nohalha unthumiha. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Nkoncherera eeraka, “Yolha phi nlhatu no uhimeriani wiira khaawo ntu nohalha uwa uwannyaka aahorihiyeke ni Athithi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, owiittucha enchi anttwarattwara Yesu, nkayaarukunuwa utulhi ni uhinttwara tho. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkaakoha owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi alhe eeraka, “Ni inyu mwaatti, chani khannokittwara?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nirweeke wa apani tho? Inyuva phi ri ni malhove o univaha ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Ni hii vano nihorumelhelha ni uchuwelha wiira, inyu phi ntakatifu rumiye ni Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahoothanlhani mwaatti khumi ni elhi, ngati? Nansho mmoka inyu, yoyo nakare!” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Vavawo aari amwaachaka Yuda, mwaana a Nasimoni Isikariote, ukhalhawaya Yuda phi akelha unthumiha, inakhalhaka aari mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi alhe.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni ashihima awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umalhawaya yayo, Yesu aari munkwahani alhukamaka Ugalilaya, khaathananne weetakacha ilhapo yo Uyudea ukhalhawaya aholhelhi Ayahudi yaari athananaka umwiiva. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nihuku no Isikuukuu ya Ayahudi yo Marapatta naari ninaatamenrie, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhiya ni ashihima awe wiira, “Nthameke vaa nrweeke Uyudea, owiittucha inyu yooneke mitheko chinyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ntu khanovitha chinopanga awe akhalhaka wiira nothanana uchuwania mwaattuni. Ukhalhawaya nnopanga cho ushangiha, mpangeke etu ilhapo yonkhaye ichuwelheke!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ata ashihima awe khayanrumelhenlhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ikatema aka kinaphiya. Nansho mwaattiva va kila ikatema inouphwanelhani. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ilhapo khiinooria uuvengani mwaattiva, nansho miyaano inookivenga ukhalhawaya mii kinohimiechesha wiira mitheko chaya chiri cho uhilhoka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nrweeke etu u sikuukuuni uwo. Miyaano khakinorwaa, ukhalhawaya ikatema aka yo ulhoka khinaphiya.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkoolhumacha yayo malhove ayo, nkaahalha Ugalilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nihuku no isikuukuu yo marapatta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ashihima awe yamalheke urwaa u sikuukuuni, Yesu ni uyo nkaarwa, nansho khaarweelhe wo wiichooniha, aarweelhe wo wiivitha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aholhelhi Ayahudi yaari amwaaviaka va sikuukuuni vawo, nkayaakoha, “Ri vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Malhove menchi o waapiya nkayeewiya mwaattuni. Attu akina nkayeera, “Ntu orera nrima.” Akina nkayeera, “Mena! Nowiiraka waathwelhelhiha attu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho khaawo ntu aalhikanche wulhumacha mwaha wawe voonene wo woova aholhelhi Ayahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Isikuukuu yaari inaphiyenlhe variyari, Yesu vaarwelhe awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku ni uchokholha weettuchiha attu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayaashanga chinene ni wiira, “Ulha ntu ulha pantte vayi irusho ni uyo khanashoma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Meettuchiho kineettuchiha aka kahiwe awaka, nansho awawe Nlhuku kirumme. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ntu nopanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku, noochuwelha wiira meettuchiho aka akhumme wa Nlhuku, ama miyaano kinoolhumacha wo ikuru aka kimwanene. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ntu noolhumacha wo ikuru awe mwanene naavia nthimicho wawe mwanene. Nansho naavia nthimicho wa ntu nrumme, yoyo ri o ikekhiaye, hinanaraka variwoothe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Chani, ashinna Musa khayovanheni Malhehero? Nansho khaawo hata mmoka inyu novara Malhehero. Nlhatu waani nnothanana ukiiva?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Attu nkayaamwaakhulha, “Nrii ni nshoka no unanara inyu ayi! Apani anothanana uwiivani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahopanga yo ushangiha imoka, ni inyu onkhaye nkamwaashanga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ashinna Musa yaholheherani weenelha achishaana inyu, inakhalhaka wiira ashinna Musa kahena aachokhonlhe, nansho manyaapwiiya inyu phi achokhonlhe. Alha mahuku, mwaattiva nnoomwinelha unyawo mwanhima nlhopwana hata Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka etu mwanhima nowiinelhiya unyawo hata Nihuku no Wiittuwa wiira Malhehero a ashinna Musa ihiwonyiye, woonaka nnokithunalhelha wo nlhatu no nlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nhihukumulhe chittu wo vathe, nhukumulheke we ikekhiaye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chani ulha phi Kuristo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Attu akina o Uyerusalemu nkayeera, “Chani, ntu naaviya wiira eeviye ulhe kahena ulha? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwooneke vano! Noolhumacha voonene, mena khaawo ntu nonvaanyiha! Chani, inowooria aholhelhi ahochuwelha ikeekhene wiira ulha phi Kuristo? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nansho Kuristo vanohalha awe uwa khaawo ntu nottuna uchuwelha vakittu vanowa awe ukhumelhelha. Nansho hiyaano nihochuwelha ukhumelhenlhe awe ulha ntu ulha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe eettuchihaka u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaakhuwelha eeraka, “Eti nnera wiira nnookichuwelha, ni uchuwelha ukhumme aka? Mii khakiwilhe wo ikuru aka kimwanene. Yayo akirumme miyaano ayo, phi o ikekhiaye. Mwaattiva khannaachuwelha, <verse number="29" style="v"/>nansho miyaano kinowaachuwelha ukhalhawaya kikhumme uwannyaya, ni ayo phi kirumme.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Attu nkayaalhikacha ummara ni unttuka, nansho khaawo ntu okonlhe moono ummara ukhalhawaya isaa awe yaari ihinaphiya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Attu enchi munlhokoni mwa attu alhe yahonrumelhelha, nkayeera, “Chani, Kuristo awaaka noowa aapanga cho ushangiha chulhupalhe chinene uthepa chipangilhe awe ulha?”</para>
  <para style="s">Manyaasikari anorumiya ummara Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayeewa attu yaapaka mwaha wa Yesu. Paahi amafarisayo vamoka ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaaruma manyaasikari ammare Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Kinoolhokelha ni inyu wo mahuku vakani, yamalhaka kinoorwaa wo ayo akirumme. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nnookavia nansho khannokoona, ukhalhawaya mwaattiva khannooria uphiya wowo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayeerelhana ashineneru, “Ulha ntu ulha naarweeke vayi vahinooria ihu umpatta? Naarweeke wa Ayahudi awanenlhe ilhapo ya Ayunani, ni weettuchiha Ayunani? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Iri ni maana ani vaneera awe, ‘Nnookaavia nansho khannokipatta, vanottuna aka ukhalha mwaattiva khannooria uphiya?’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Nrapo no maashi o ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nihuku noomalhelha yeyo isikuukuu iyo naari nihuku no yekha aya, Yesu nkeemelha ni wulhumacha wo nlhove nulhupalhe eeraka, “Ntu nowolhiya nttona aweeke uwannyaka, <verse number="38" style="v"/>ntu nokirumelhelha nowa aawuria. Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya, ‘Ntu nokirumelhelha mii, marapo o maashi anowiiha ukumi anothekhuma munrimani mwawe!’ ” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu olhumanche chiicho amwaachaka Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nottuna aya umpochera alhe attu anrumelhenlhe ayo. Yeyo ikatema iyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari hinawa ukhalhawaya Yesu aari hinaya upochera nthimicho wawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Umwalhaana wa attu wo nlhatu na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Attu akina mwaattuni mmo nkayaamwiwa olhumachaka yayo malhove ayo, nkayeera, “Wo ikekhiaye ulha ntu ulha phi Namilhohi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Akina aya nkayeera, “Ulha phi Kuristo Moopolhi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho akina tho nkayeera, “Kuristo Moopolhi khaanooria ukhuma Ugalilaya! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Malhove Matakatifu aneera wiira, Kuristo naakhumeke iyari ya Amwene Adaudi, ni uyaria Ubethelehemu, iwani yaakhalha aya Adaudi!” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Paahi mwaha wa Yesu nkawaamwalhaaniha attu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Attu akina athananaka unttuka, nansho khaawo ammanre.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhirumelhelha wa Aholhelhi Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Manyaasikari yahokolhieke, nkayaakohiya ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo, “Chani woonaka khannammanra ni ummwiiha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Manyaasikari nkayaakhulha, “Khaawo ntu o wooria wulhumacha thoko chinoolhumacha awe ulha ntu ulha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayaakoha, “Chani, ni inyu mwaatti chiicho nhothepiya? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Chani ahawo anakhalhaka mmoka a aholhelhi a attu, ama mmoka a Amafarisayo anrumelhenlhe? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ulha nlhoko ulha khuchuwenlhe Malhehero a ashinna Musa, paahi etu uholhaviya ni Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mmoka a Amafarisayo aari Nanikodemo yanrweenlhe Yesu mahuku avinre alhe. Paahi, yayo nkayeerelha akhunanaya wiira, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Wo ulhikaana ni Malhehero ihu khaninooria unhukumulha ntu nihinaaya umwiiwelhelha ni uchuwelha ttenkeni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayaamwakhulha, “Chani ni inyuva chiicho nnokhuma Ugalilaya? Nrweeke mwashomeke Malhove Matakatifu etu ni inyu nnokooshoma wiira, khaawo namilhohi nohalha ukhuma Ugalilaya.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Paahi attu onkhaye nkayaahokolhiacha mmawannyaya.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nthiyana aavariye muulhuvani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kila ntu nkaahokolhia uwannyawe, nansho Yesu nkaarwa waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wichishuru waashelhe waya nkaarwa tho u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Attu onkhaye nkayanrukureriacha, nkaakhalha ni uchokholha wettuchiha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo nkayammwiiha nthiyana mmoka aaphwanyeriye mu ulhuvani, nkayaamwemesha variyari aya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha! Ulha nthiyana ulha hophwanyeriya alhuvaka. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Malhehero ihu ya ashinna Musa yahoniruma wiira nthiyana thoko ulha awonyeriye malhuku mpaka akhwe. Paahi etu inyuva nneera chani?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>olhumacha chiicho wo unria, apatte nlhatu wo umwirelha wiira hotteka. Nansho Yesu nkooroma, nkaakheria vathi ni nikokho nawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yathepeke unkoha, Yesu nkennuwa nkeerelha, “Ntu riyoothe hinawonya munkwahani mwinyu, yoyo awonyeke nlhuku no upacha.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nkooroma tho, nkaakheria tho vathi vattayani. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Veewilhe aya chiicho, nkayaachokholha uthama mmokammoka, aholhelhaka ashulhupalhe. Yesu nkaahiya yeekha awe ni athiyana alhe aahanlhe aneemenlhe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu vennuwilhe awe nkaakoha athiyana ayo, “Ari vayi attu ayo? Khaawo hata mmoka hanlhe ohukumulheni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nthiyana uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, khaawo inakhalhaka mmoka!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeera, “Mena miyaano khakinoohukumulhani. Nrweeke, nansho nhiwonye tho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu phi nthuko wo ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha weerelha Amafarisayo tho. “Miyaano phi nthuko wo ilhapo, ntu nokittwara mii nookhalha ni nthuko wo ukumi, khaneeta mpiiphini.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayaamwirelha, “Inyuva nnehimiacha mwaanene, uhimiechesha winyu kuhiwe we ikekhiaye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Anakhalhaka kineehimiechesha kimwanene, uhimiechesha waka urii we ikeekhene ukhalhawaya miyaano kihochuwelha ukhumme aka ni uwo unokelha aka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnohukumulha wo irusho cha attu, nansho miyaano khakinonhukumulha ntu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Uhukumulha waka, urii we ikeekhene ukhalhawaya miyaano khakirii vekha aka, Athithi akirumme arii vamoka ni mii. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iholhepiya nhina Malhehero inyu wiira uhimiechesha wa attu elhi weewananaka, inohimia aya phi ikeekhene. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Miyaano kineehimiacha kimwanene, ni ayo Athithi akirumme, anookihimiechesha chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayankoha, “Athumwaninyu ayo ari vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva khannokichuwelha mii mena khannaachuwelha Athumwanaka. Yakhalhaka mwaanokichuwelha mii, mwaanachuwelha ni Athumwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu olhumanche yayo malhove ayo u Inupa ya Nlhuku, nchuumbani mwo nikhupi no ushungiya nchurukhu vaari awe ettuchihaka. Mena khaawo ntu ammanre, ukhalhawaya isaa awe yaari ihinaphiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Unokelha aka mwaattiva khannooria uphiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera tho, “Kinoorwaa, ni inyu nnookaavia, nansho nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu. Unokelha aka mii, mwaattiva khannooria urwaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayeera, “Chani, nowichiiva? Woonaka neera, ‘Unokelha aka mwaattiva khannooria uphiya?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva nkhumme vava vathi vaa, miyaano kikhumme wiirimu uchulhu, mwaattiva o velhaponi va, miyaano kakihiwe o velhaponi va. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Phi nlhatu no uwirelhani wiira nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu. Paahi wo ikekhiaye, mwaahirumelhelheke etu wiira ‘Miyaano phi Yoyo,’ nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayankoha, “Inyuva phi apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kihoohimeriani ukhuma khalhayi! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kihanaa menchi o wulhumacha ni uhukumulhani. Nansho akirumme mii ayo phi ikeekhene, ni mii kinohimiacha wa attu o velhaponi mwaha kiiwalhe aka uwannyaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Khayachuwenlhe wiira Yesu olhumacha mwaha wa Athithi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Vanottuna inyu umwiinulha Mwaana a Ntu, vavawo nnowa mwaachuwelha wiira ‘Miyaano phi Yoyo,’ ni wiira khakinopanga iriyoothe miyaano kimwanene, nansho kinoolhumacha wo ikuru ivahiye ni Athithi wiira kuulhumache. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Akirumme arii vamoka ni mii mahuku onkhaye, yayo khanakihiya vekha ukhalhawaya chinopanga aka chinowateelhiha nrima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Attu enchi yaamwiwilhe Yesu olhumachaka yahonrumelhelha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaana a Nlhuku nouhiyererani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha Ayahudi anrumelhenlhe alhe wiira, “Mwarumelhelhaka meettuchiho aka, nnookhalha owiittucha aka we ikekhiaye. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vavawo nnochuwelha ikekhiaye, ni iyo inouhiyererani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Hiyaano phi iyari ya Aburahimu, nihipachaka ukhalha akavihi a ntu riyoothe. Wo nlhatu waani nneera, ‘Nnohiyereriya?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, kila ntu nowonya phi ipotta yo uwonya. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ipotta khirina ikuru yo lhokelha vawani, nansho mwaana hanaa ikuru yo ulhokelha mahuku onkhaye. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mwaana ohiyererakani, nnohiyereriya wo ikekhiaye. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kihochuwelha wiira mwaattiva phi iyari ya Aburahimu. Nansho anakhalhaka chiicho, nnothanana ukiiva ukhalhawaya khannorumelhelha meettuchiho aka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Miyaano kinohimiacha chilhe chikoonihilhe aya Athithi, nansho mwaattiva nnopanga chilhe chihimeriye inyu ni athumwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ayo nkayaamwakhulha, “Athumwanihu phi Aburahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Thoko mwaattiva mwakaari ashaana a Aburahimu, mwampanga thoko chaapanga aya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Miyaano kihoohimeriani ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, nansho anakhalhaka chiicho, mwaattiva nnothanana ukiiva. Aburahimu khayaapannge chiicho! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnopanga mwaha thoko yoolhe waapanga aya athumwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ayo nkayaamwirelha, “Hiyaano kanihiwe ashaana niyariye muulhuvani! Nihanaa Athithi amoka tu, Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ikaari wiira Nlhuku phi Athumwaninyu, mwaanokittuna miyaano, ukhalhawaya miyaano kikhumme wa Nlhuku ni vano kirii vaa. Khakiwilhe wo ikuru aka kimwanene, nansho yayo phi kirumilhe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Woonaka khannochuwelha yayo malhove kinoolhumacha aka ayo? Ukhalhawaya khanneewelhelha nttenga aka. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mwaattiva phi ashaana a Nakare, nttwarattwaraka nikakata na athumwaninyu. Toka machokholhelho yayo arii owiiva ahikhalhaka mu ikekhiani, ukhalhawaya ikeekhene khiiwo nhina mwaya. Kila vanolhumacha aya, aneera wo ulhikaana ni mayareelho aya, ukhalhawaya arii owoothacha ni anaangoro o woothacha wonkhaye. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nansho miyaano kinohimiacha ikeekhene, ukhalhaka phi nlhatu winyu wo uhikirumelhelha. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mpani mmoka inyu nooria wooniha wiira kihowonya? Nansho yakhalhaka wiira kinoolhumacha aka iyo phi ikeekhene, woonaka khannokirumelhelha? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ntu a Nlhuku nowiiwelhelha malhove a Nlhuku. Nansho, mwaattiva, khanhiwe a Nlhuku, phi ri aya chiichammo etu khanneewelhelha malhove awe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahaawo Aburahimu ahinaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayannyoholhacha Yesu yiiraka, “Chani, khavanlhoka vaneera ihu wiira inyuva mwa Asamariya, nri ni nshoka no unanara?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Miyaano khakirina nshoka. Miyaano kinaathimicha Athumwanaka, nansho mwaattiva khannokithimicha. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Miyaano khakineechaviera nthimicho aka kimwanene. Nansho hawo naavia yoyo nthimicho uyo, ni uyo phi nohukumulha. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu neewelhelha meettuchiho aka khanowa aakhwa nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha, “Paahi etu nihochuwelha vano wiira nrini nshoka! Aburahimu yahokhwa, anamilhohi ni ayo yahokwa, ni inyu nneera eti, Neewelhelha meettuchiho inyu khanokhwa, nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Athumwanihu Aburahimu ahokhwa, chani woonaka inyuva nneepanga olhupalhe waapwaha Aburahimu? Anamilhohi ni ayo ahokhwacha. Ana inyuva nneechoona thoko apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Keethimichaka kimwanene, nthimicho aka kuhiwe ittu. Amoka anokithimicha mii phi Athumwanaka, aneera inyu mwaattiva wiira phi Nlhuku inyu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mwaattiva khannaachuwelha. Nansho kikenre wiira khakinaachuwelha, kaanothacha thoko mwaattivava. Nansho kihaachuwelha ni uvara nlhove naya. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Athumwaninyu Aburahimu yahottapelhelha wiira anowoona nihuku naka no uwa, ni ayo yahoona, nkayaateelhiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayankoha, “Inyuva khannaphiyelha iyaakha makhumi nthanu, ni inyu nneera wiira nhoona Aburahimu?” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Aburahimu ahinayaria, ‘Miyaano kihawo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayalhokottacha malhuku ammonyere, nansho Yesu nkaathama, nkaakhuma u Inupa ya Nlhuku.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu ohoona iyareelho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe eetakachaka, ahomwoona ntu mmoka ohoona toka iyareelho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, phi apani awonyilhe, ulha ntu ulha, ama manyanaangoro awe, hata ayariee hoonaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “U uhoona wu, khupangeelhe nlhatu no uwonya wawe, ama uwonya wa manyanaangoro awe. Aayarelhe hoonaka Nlhuku wiira awe ooniha ikuru awe chinopanga aya ntheko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Uhinaya wiilha, nihothananiya uthepa uvara ntheko waya akirumme, uhiyu unoowa vahinooria awe ntu uvara ntheko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vanolhokelha aka velhaponi, miyaano phi nthuko wo ilhapo.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo, nkaashuwa ishenye vathi, nkoothuwa ipephe, nkanhika ntu ohoona ulhe mmiithoni, <verse number="7" style="v"/>nkaamwirelha, “Urweeke wakhucheke u nttiya no Siloamu.” Maana o nenno nchina nno nikhalhaka “Rumiye”. Ntu ohoona ulhe nkaarwa, nkaakhucha, nkaahokolhia nari oonaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Amwaatamana awe ni attu yaamwoona alhepelhaka, nkayeera, “Chani, ulha kahena ntu aakhalha ni ulhepelha ulhe?” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Attu akina yeera, “Phi yoyo.” Nansho attu akhwawe nkayeera, “Mena kahena! Howiiraka ulhikaana ni uyo.” Nansho ntu ahoona ulhe nkeera, “Phi miyaano!” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkayankohacha, “Miitho inyu ayo yenre chani wo uttukulhiya?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkaakhulha, “Ntu neehaniya Yesu ulhe ahoothuwa ipephe, nkaakihika mmiithoni, ni ukiirelha, ‘Nrweeke mwakhucheke uri nttiya no Siloamu.’ Nkakaarwaa, vaari aka kikhuchaka, nkakaachokholha woona.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkayankoha, “Yoyo ntu uyo etu ri vayi?” Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Akichuwenlhe mii.”</para>
  <para style="s">Amafarisayo anookohakoha mwaha wo ulhamihiya ntu ohoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkayanrweha ntu aari ohoona uyo wa Amafarisayo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku Yesu voothuwa awe ipephe ni unttukulha miitho ntu uyo nno, naari Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amafarisayo nkayankoha yoyo ntu uyo, enre chani wo woona. Ni uyo nkeera, “Ahookihika ipephe mmiithoni, Nkakaakhucha wiitho, ni mii vano kinowoona.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina nkayeera, “Ntu pannge chiicho khakhumme wa Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya khavarechenshe Malhehero o Nihuku no Wiittuwa.” Nansho akina nkayeera, “Ntu o uwonya nooria chani upanga cho ushangiha thoko chilha?” Nkawaakhulhanachiya iriyari aya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkayankoha tho ntu aari ohoona ulhe, “Ukhalhawaya yoyo hoottukulhani miitho, nnomwoona thoko mpani?” Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Kinomwoona yoyo, phi namilhohi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka chiicho, Aholhelhi a Ayahudi khayarumelhenlhe wiira yoyo ntu uyo aari ohoona khalhayi vawo nansho vano nowoona, mpaka veehanne aya manyanaangoro awe, <verse number="19" style="v"/>nkayaakoha, “Chani ulha phi mwamwaninyu? Nneera inyu aayarelhe hoonaka, vano pantte vayi woona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro awe nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo ulha phi mwaamwanihu, aayarelhe hoonaka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho khanichuwenlhe wiira enre chani wo woona, mena khanichuwenlhe ntu nttukunlhee miitho awe. Munkoheke mwanene, honnuwa, nowooria wulhumacha mwanene!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro awe ayo yoolhumanche chiicho ukhalhawaya yaari yoovaka aholhelhi Ayahudi, aalhehenre wiira ntu riyoothe nottuna urumelhelha eeraka wiira Yesu phi Kuristo oomolhiye nnupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Phi nlhatu etu no manyanaangoro awe ayo wiira, “Honnuwa, munkoheke mwanene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nkayaamwiihana nkwaha wo nayelhi ntu aari ohoona chiyareelho uyo, nkayaamwirelha, “Mummaheke Nlhuku nthimicho wiira nnohimia ikeekhene! Hiyaano nihochuwelha wiira ntu olhaminheni uyo rii o uwonya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uyo nkaakhulha, “Akhalhaka o uwonya miyaano khakichuwenlhe. Nansho ittu imoka kinochuwelha aka, kaari ohona, ni vano kinowoona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkayaathepa unkoha, “Opangenlheni chani? Ottukunlheni chani miitho inyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nkaakhulha, “Kihomalha uhimeriani, ni inyu khamwiiwelhenlhe. Nlhatu waani vano nnothanana wiiwa tho? Chani mwaattiva nnothanana ukhalha owiittucha awe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nansho ayo nkayannyoholhacha yiiraka, “Inyuva phi owiittucha awe, nansho hiyaano owiittucha a ashinna Musa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hiyaano nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku aholhumana ashinna Musa, nansho ulha ntu ulha khanichuwenlhe khumme vayi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Vari vo ushangiha! Mwaattiva khanchuwenlhe khumme vayi, nansho mii hokittukulha miitho aka! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku khaneewelhelha attu o uwonya, ila neewelhelha attu anonthimicha ni upanga chinothanana awe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ukhuma vachokhonlhe aya ilhapo khiinewania wiira ntu honttukulha miitho ntu ayarelhe hoonaka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo khakhumme wa Nlhuku, khanooria upanga ittu iriyoothe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Inyuva mwaayarelhe ni ulhelhiya mu uwonyani, nnooria chani uniittuchiha hiyaano?” Nkayaamomolha nnupani mwo lhapelha.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhoona wo Munrimani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu veewilhe awe yoyo mwaha uyo, nkaamwona ntu oomolhiye nnupani mwo ulhapelha uyo nkankoha, “Chani, inyuva nnonrumelhelha Mwaana a Ntu?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, nkihimerie yoyo phi mpani, kinrumelhelhe!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nhomwoona, ni uyo phi noolhumacha ni inyu vano.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Paahi yoyo ntu uyo nkeera, “Thithi! Kinoorumelhelha.” Nkankhoromelha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Miyaano kiwilhe velhaponi uwaahukumulhani attu, ahinoona oone, ni ayo aneechona wiira anowoona akhalhe ohoona.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina yaari vavawo ni uyo nkayeewa yayo malhove ayo, nkayankoha, “Chani, nneera wiira ni hii nirii ohoona chiicho?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwakaari ohoona, khamwakhalha ni milhatu cho utteka, nansho nneepanga wiira ‘Hiyaano ninowoona,’ ni iyo phi nooniha wiira bado nhowonya.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no Nshunga o khondoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu hinokelha wo uvira vanlhakoni ihilhi yo ikhondoro, apephenyaka ni uwelha wo iphiro ikina, yoyo ntu owiiya ni o uvara makhuche. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nansho nokelha wo uvira vanlhakoni, yoyo phi nshunga o ikhondoro. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nolhitelhelha ihilhi nonhulhelha nchelhe ni ikhondoro chinowiiwa nlhove nawe. Nowoopa nthuri wiihana ikhondoro chawe kila imoka wo nchina naya, ni uholhelha vathe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chamalhaka ukhuma vathe, nooholhelha uholho, ni ikhondoro chinonttwara, ukhalhawaya chihonchuwelha nshunga aya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ikhondoro khachinooria unttwara ntu hiri mwanene, chinonttawa ukhalhawaya khachichuwenlhe nthuri wawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu ahaahimeria nenno nlhikaaniho nno, nansho ayo khayachuwenlhe maana aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Nshunga Orera Nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera tho, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Miyaano phi nlhako wo ikhondoro. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Akina ayo, onkhaye aawilhe kihinaya mii, phi owiiya ni owaakha, ni ikhondoro khacheewelhenlhe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Miyaano phi nlhako. Ntu nokelha wo uvirelha uwannyaka nowoopolhiya, nookelha ni ukhuma, ni upatta malhiho. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu owiiya anowa wo nrima wo wiiya, wiiva ni utanganya. Miyaano kiwilhe wiira mwaatti mpatte ukhalha ni ukumi, ukumi wo utimira.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Miyaano phi nshunga orera nrima, nokumiha ukumi awe wo nlhatu no wiinanelha ikhondoro chawe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Namitheko o ulhiviya, hirii nshunga, ni ikhondoro chihikhalhaka chawawe, vanoona awe mwiichi uwaaka, noohiya ikhondoro ni uttawa, mwiichi nkawaavara ikhondoro ni umwarushacha. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yoyo noottawa wo uhilhoha ittu, ukhalhawaya uyo rii namitheko o ulhiviya tu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Miyaano phi nshunga orera nrima. Kinowaachuwelha arii awaka, ni ayo arii awaka anookichuwelha miyaano, <verse number="15" style="v"/>thoko Athithi vanokichuwelha aya, ni mii chinaachuwelhaka Athithi. Miyaano kinookumiha ukumi aka wo nlhatu naya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Chihawo tho ikhondoro chikina chawaka chihiri nhiilhini mu. Kihothananiya uwiiha ni chiyo, ni chiyo chinowiiwa nlhove naka, ni ukhalha mphingo mmoka ni nshunga mmoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Athithi anokittuna ukhalhawaya kinookumiha ukumi aka wiira kiwe kaapochera tho. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu o ukithurulha ukumi aka, miyaano kinokumiha wo uttuna waka kimwanene. Kihanaa ikuru yo ukumiha ni yo ukusha tho. Chiichammo phi malheheriyo kirumme aya Athithi kipange.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uhiiwanana nkawaakhumelhelha tho munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi wo nlhatu no yayo malhove ayo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Attu enchi yaari yiiraka, “Ri ni nshoka no unanara. Ri ni ihalhahalha! Ye ishiyani umwiiwelhelha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho attu akina nkayeera, “Ntu o nshoka no unanara khanooria wulhumacha malhove thoko alha! Nshoka ninooria chani uttukulha miitho a attu ohona?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhotiya ni Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yayo mahuku ayo waari nlhaalha wo uririya, ni nihuku no wuupuwelha uttukuriya Inupa ya Nlhuku naari nittapelhelhiyaka Uyerusalemu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu aari eetakachaka u Inupa ya Nlhuku vaari nipirothi ni Naselemani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayanrukureria ni unkoha, “Nnohalha unihiya nichukulhaka mpaka yaakhani? Nkanihimerieni ikeekhene, chani inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kihoohimeriani, nansho khannorumelhelha. Mitheko chinopanga aka miyaano wo nchina na Athumwanaka phi nokihimiechesha, <verse number="26" style="v"/>nansho mwaattiva khannorumelhelha, ukhalhawaya mwaattiva kanhena ikhondoro chaka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ikhondoro chaka chinowiiwa nlhove naka, ni mii kinochuwelhacha, ni chiyo chinokittwara. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Miyaano kinowaavaha attu ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, ni ayo khanokhwa tho. Khaawo ntu nooria ukithurulha mmathathani mwaka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Athumwanaka akivanhe chechiyo phi olhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye, khaawo nooria waathurulha Athithi mmathathani mwaya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Athithi ni Miyaano niri amokaaru.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayaalhokotta malhuku tho wiira amwaate. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Kihopanga ntheko mwinchi kivahiye aka na Athithi mwoonaka, phi ntheko waani etu wo chechiyo unoopangani nkaate ni malhuku?” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayaamwaakhulha, “Khaninowaatani malhuku wo nlhatu no mitheko choombone, nansho wo nlhatu no unlhava Nlhuku! Ukhalhawaya nneepanga Nlhuku, uno nnari ntu thoko hii.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, kilhepiye nhina Malhehero inyu wiira Nlhuku heera, ‘Miyaano kihohimia, mwaattiva milhuku?’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nihochuwelha wiira chinohimiya ni Malhove Matakatifu chiri che ikeekhene mahuku onkhaye, Nlhuku eehanaka yayo attu ayo milhuku, attu arwehelhiye nttenga awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Thoko chiri aka mii, Athithi ahokithanlha ni ukiruma velhaponi. Veeshiyani etu, nneera wiira kihonlhava Nlhuku wo wiipanga Mwaana a Nlhuku? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nhikirumelhelheke etu, yakhalhaka wiira khakinopanga mitheko chilheheriyaka ni Athumwanaka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nansho yakhalhaka kinoopanga, ata mwaahikirumelhelheke, mena etu nrumelhelheke mitheko chiyo, wo uchuwelha wiira Athithi anookhalha nhina mwaka, ni mii kinookhalha nhina mwa Athithi.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nkayaamwiithelha wiira ammare tho Yesu, nansho nkaakulhupuwa mmathathani mwaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahokolhia tho ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Yorodani, vakittu Nayohana vaari aya aabatiizaka attu, nkaakhalha wowo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Attu enchi nkayanrwelha nkayeera, “Nayohana khayaapannge yo ushangiha iriyoothe. Nansho yoolhumanche aya Nayohana amwaachaka ulha ntu ulha onkhaye aari e ikeekhene.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ni attu enchi vavawo nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nookhwa a Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka eehaniya Lazaro, nnenchi o Bethaniya, aari nreta. Ubethaniya waari ittoko yaakhalha aya Amariamu ni arokoraya Namatha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amariamu phi alhe yaahikilhe makhura o unukhelha Athithi mmietoni ni waapoholha ni ikharari chaya. Lazaro, mwanhima aya yayo phi ari nreta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi yayo manyarokorawe ayo nkayaarweha nttenga wa Yesu, “Thithi, ampwana inyu nnaattuna inyu areta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu eeweke chiicho, nkeera, “Yoyo ureta uyo khunommwiiha nookhwa, nansho wo nlhatu no unthimicha Nlhuku. Anowereiya ikhalhe phi iphiro yo uthimichiya Mwaana a Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu ahaattuna Namatha, Amariamu arokoraya ni Nalazaro. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Veewilhe awe nttenga wiira Nalazaro areta, nkaalhokelha vavawo vaari awe vawo wo mahuku melhi tho. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Nirweeke nihokolhieke tho Uyudea!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayaamwaakhulha, “Owiittuchiha, mahuku vakani tu ahovira toka Ayahudi vaathanana aya uwaatani malhuku ni uwiivani, ni inyu nnothanana urwaa wowo tho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Isaa cho uthana khachirii khumi ni pilhi? Paahi etu, ntu neeta uthana khanokwakwathuwa, ukhalhawaya nomwalheelhiya ni nthuko wo ilhapo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nansho ntu eetaka uhiyu nookwakwathuwa, ukhalhawaya khuuwo nthuko velhaponi.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha yayo malhove ayo, ni umalhiha eeraka, “Ampwana ihu Nalazaro ahorupa, nansho Miyaano kinokelha waawusha.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, akhalhaka ahowiiraka urupa, paahi anolhama.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Owiittucha yaanyihera wiira ahowiiraka urupa nkhoveni, nansho Yesu aari ahimiaka wiira Nalazaro ahokhwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria wo uhavitha, “Nalazaro ahokhwa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>nansho kinootelhiya wo nlhatu ninyu wiira khakaariwo wowo, wiira nrumelhelhe. Paahi etu nngwee nirweeke uwannyaya uwo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Natomaso (eehaniya Nivata) nkayeerelha owiittucha ashikhunanaya wiira, “Nirweeke etu ni hii vamoka ni Owiittuchiha ihu, yakhalhaka ukhwa naakhwaneke vamoka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nihihimusho ni ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu vaaphiilhe awe wowo, nkaaphwanya Nalazaro anamanlhe uvithiya nnihiyeni mahuku macheshe avinre. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ittoko yo Ubethaniya khayaari utayi ni Uyerusalemu, nkwaha wo umalhaka imaili taaru, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ni Ayahudi enchi yaari anawiilhe u Namatha ni Amariamu uunyikalhachani nookhwa a nhima aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Namatha veewilhe aya wiira Yesu aari awaaka, nkayaarwa uumwikamelhani, nansho Amariamu ahalhaka nnupani. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Namatha nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Thithi, mwakaari vaa, nhima aka kaakhwa! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho kihochuwelha wiira hata vano iriyoothe inottuna inyu unlhepelha Nlhuku, nouvahani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mwanhima inyu noohihimmwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Namatha nkayaakhulha, “Kihochuwelha wiira anoohihimmwa nihuku no uhihimushiya attu, nihuku no umalhelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Miyaano phi nihihimusho ni ukumi. Anokirumelhelha mii anokhalha akumi, anakhwaaka, <verse number="26" style="v"/>ni kila ntu ri nkumi nokirumelhelha, khanokhwa ngu nnokhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Chani, nnoorumelhelha yayo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Namatha nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo Thithi! Miyaano kinoorumelhelha wiira inyuva phi Kuristo, Mwaana a Nlhuku, nowa velhaponi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noomoriha miithori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Namatha yamalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkayaarwaa weehanani Amariamu, arokoraya, untemerani, nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha ahowa vaa, anowihanani.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ni ayo yeeweke chiicho, nkayonkwa phiyaru, nkayaamwiikamelha Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu aari hinaphiya vawani, nansho aari bado wowulhe Namatha waamwiikamenlhe aya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Paahi etu Ayahudi yaakhanlhe mpaani yaavahaka nrima Amariamu, voonne aya yunkwaka ni ukhuma vathe wo uhipicha, nkayaattwara. Yaanyihera wiira anokelha unihiyeni uwunlhani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Paahi Amariamu vaaphilhe aya vaari awe Yesu ni umwoona, ahokhoroma, nkayeera, “Thithi, thoko mwakaari vaa, nhima aka kaakhwa!” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu ooneke Amariamu yunlhaka, ni Ayahudi yaawilhe vamoka ni ayo yunlhaka, nkaakelhiya ikiriri ni ihuzuni munrimani. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkaakoha, “Mwaavinthe vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwakhulha, “Thithi mmweeke mwoona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamoriha miithori. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Paahi Ayahudi nkayeera, “Mwooneke chinre awe wo unttuna!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nansho attu akina aya nkayeera, “Ahaattukulha miitho attu ohoona, ngati? Chani khoonrie waachiichiha Nalazaro ahikhwe?”</para>
  <para style="s">Nalazaro anohihimushiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu aari onlhaka munrimani, nkaarwa unihiyeni, nihiye naari iphaa, ninakhuneelhiye nlhuku nulhupalhe vanlhakoni. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Nithamihiye nlhuku nno!”</para>
  <para style="p">Namatha, akhwelhiye ni mwanrokoraya Lazaro ayo, nkayeera, “Thithi, vanoonukha. Mahuku macheshe vano toka vavithiye aya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani, khakoohimenrieni wiira mwarumelhelhaka nnowoona nthimicho wa Nlhuku?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nkayaathamiha nlhuku nne. Yesu nkaaweha nchulhu wiirimu, nkeera, “Kihopochera Thithi, ukhalhawaya inyuva nnookiwelhelha. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kihochuwelha wiira nnookiiwelhelha mahuku onkhaye, nansho kinoolhumacha yayo wo nlhatu na alha attu arii vaa alha, wiira arumelhelhe, wiira inyuva phi kirumme.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu amalhiheke wulhumacha yayo, nkeehana wo nlhove nulhupalhe eeraka, “Nalazaro! Nkhume vathe!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nalazaro nkayaakhuma vathe, uno anattukiye isaanda mmietoni ni mmiononi, wiitho unakhuneelhiye. Yesu nkeera, “Mwaathaphulheke, mwaahiyeke arweeke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Miruku cho umwiiva Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Paahi Ayahudi enchi yawaachilhe wa Amariamu yooneke cheechiyo chaapannge awe Yesu, nkayanrumelhelha. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nansho akina aya nkayaarwaa wa Amafarisayo uwaahimeriani mwaha waapannge awe Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo nkayaapanga ntemera wo Ibaraza yuulhupalhe, nkayeera, “Niireke chanii? Mwooneke chineera awe wo upanga cho ushangiha!<figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Opochera ishaani a Ayahudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nanhiyaka, kila ntu nonrumelhelha, ni aholhelhi o Urumi anoowa uphomolha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni ukusha ilhapo ihu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Amoka aya, yeehaniya Nakayafa, yaari opochera ishaani olhupalhe yeyo iyaakha iyo, nkeerelhacha, “Mwaattiva khannochuwelha ittu! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Chani, khannoona wiira nambaya ntu mmoka akhwe wo nlhatu ni attu, ilhapo yonkhaye ihirimeelhihiye?” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yayo khayoolhumanche chiicho wo uttuna waya anene, nansho ukhalhawaya yaari opochera ishaani olhupalhe yeyo iyaakha iyo, yaholhohera wiira Yesu nookhwa wo nlhatu no ilhapo aya, <verse number="52" style="v"/>mena kuhena wo nlhatu na Ayahudi vekha, nansho wo waawiha vamoka ashaana a Nlhuku amwareelhe velhaponi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ukhuma nenno nihuku nno etu, aholhelhi Ayahudi yahopanga miruku cho uthanana umwiiva Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu Yesu kheente tho voonene munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi, nansho nkaathama vavawo nkaarwa waatamenrie uthako, iwani ineehaniya Efuraimu. Nkaakhalha wowo vamoka ni owiittucha awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Nihuku na Ayahudi no Pasaka naari ninaatamenrie, ni attu enchi yahorwaa Uyerusalemu wiira ehapihe nihinaaya nihuku nno. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Attu nkayaahalha amwaaviaka Yesu, ni ayo vaathothokanne aya vamoka nnupani Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkayaakohanacha ashineneru, “Ninoona chani mwaatti? Inowooria wiira khanowa usikuukuni, ama noowa?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo nkayaalhehera attu wiira ntu chuwenlhe vakittu vari awe Yesu arwee aahimiachere ni ayo yammare.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohikiya makhura Ubethaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mahuku sita nihinaaya nihuku no Pasaka, Yesu ahorwaa Ubethaniya uwannyaya Nalazaro aahihimushiye ni Yesu ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wowo ahoterekelhiya yolhia yo uchechilho, yaaterekhiye ni Namatha, Nalazaro ni ayo ahokhalha vamezani vamoka ni Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu Amariamu nkayaawia ntikha ilita yo makhura o unukhelha chinene o uhithakanihiya aathumihiya wo nchurukhu mwinchi, nkayanhika makhura Yesu mmietoni ni umpoholha wo ikharari chaya. Nihiriri nkanaachara mpaani mwonkhaye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yuda Isikariote, owiittucha mmoka aya khumi ni elhi, nohalha unthumiha Yesu, nkeera, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Wo nlhatu waani etu alha makhura alha uhithumihiya wo nchurukhu idinari imia taaru, ni uvahiya amashikini?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>olhumanche chiicho, kuhena wiira anaachukulhelha amashikini, nansho ukhalhawaya aari ntu owiiya. Eiyaka munrupani mwo ushungelha nchurukhu weetana awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nhaahuvihe amanyi alha! Mwaahiyeke akeesheke tayari wo nihuku naka no uvithiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Amashikini nnowaakhalhana mahuku onkhaye, nansho khannokhalha ni mii wo mahuku onkhaye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Miruku cho weeva Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Attu enchi munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi nkayeewa wiira Yesu rii Ubethaniya, paahi etu, nkayaarwaa wowo, kuhiwe nansho wo nlhatu noomwona Yesu, nansho woona Nalazaro yaahihimushiye ni Yesu ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaapanga miruku cho weeva Nalazaro, <verse number="11" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya wo nlhatu naya Ayahudi enchi yahohiya weewelhelha, nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noopocheriya Uyerusalemu wo nkhito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya, milhoko chinchi cha attu chaawilhe usikuukuni chaheewa wiira Yesu aari mphironi uwa Uyerusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi etu, nkayakushacha maritta o mitende, nkayaarwaa umwiikamelhani, akhuwelhaka eeraka,</para>
  <para style="q">“Atotopelhiye Nlhuku! Athimichiye uyo nowa wo nchina na Athithi.</para>
  <para style="q">Athimichiye Amwene o Uisraeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawiiheriya mwaaphuta mmoka, nkaawelha vachulhu vawe thoko chinohimiya aya ni Malhove Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Nhoove iwani yo Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q">Mummweheke, Mwene inyu noowa,</para>
  <para style="q">nammwenlhe mwaaphuta!”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe yaari ahichuwelhaka yoyo mwaha uyo, nansho Yesu amalheke uthimichiya, phi opuwenlhe aya wiira Malhove Matakatifu yaholhepiya, amwaachaka wiira attu yahompangelha yayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Attu yaari vamoka ni Yesu nihuku yeehanne awe Nalazaro ukhuma nnihiyeni, aahihimushaka ukhuma nnookhwani, yahonhimiechesha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nenno etu phi nlhatu no wiikamelhiya ni nlhoko mwinchi wa attu, ukhalhawaya yaheewa wiira Yesu ahopanga yeyo yo ushangiha iyo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paahi, Amafarisayo nkayeerelhana, “Nnowoona vano? Khaninooria upanga ittu iriyoothe! Mmweheke, ilhapo yonkhaye inonttwara!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ayunani akina anothanana umwoona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ahokhalha Ayunani mumphingoni mwa attu yaarwelhe Uyerusalemu uuthimichani nihuku no Pasaka nno. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nkayarwaa u Nafilipo, anenchi o Ubethsaida yo Galilaya, ni wiira, “Pwiiya, ninothanana umwoona Yesu.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nafilipo nkayaarwaa, nkayeerelha Naandorea, ni ayo oyelhi nkayaarwaa unhimeriani Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Isaa yo uthimichiya Mwaana a Ntu ihophiya! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, imbeyu yo marupi inohalha imbeyuru yaahimoreke vattayani ni ukhwa. Yakhwaaka, phi noyara aya marupi menchi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Attu anottuna ukumi aya anoopoteriha, anovenga makhalhelho o ukumi wo velhaponi va, anoshungerera wo nlhatu wo ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ntu nothanana ukikaviha ntheko, hothananiya ukittwara, ikhalhe wiira variyoothe variaka miyaano ni akarumiya aka anottuna ukhalha vavawo. Ntu nokikaviha, Athumwanaka anonvaha nthimicho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noomulhumachera nookhwa awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Vano nnepa aka unoohuperia, ni mii kuulhumachekeni etu? Chani kiire, ‘Thithi, nkoopolhe ilha ikatema ilha ihikiphiyelhe?’ Nansho phi nlhatu wo uwa waka, wiira kivire ilha ikatema yo uweria ilha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Thithi, nthimicheke vano nchina ninyu.” Vavawo nlhove nkaneewaniaa ukhuma wiirimu, “Kihothimicha, ni vavawo kinoothimicha tho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Attu yaari aneemenlhe vavawo yaheewa nenno nlhove nno, ni attu akina aya nkaanyihera ithari nansho akina aya nkayolhumacha, “Nnepa wo wiirimu uholhumacha umuulhumana!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeerelha, “Nenno nlhove nno khaniiwanelhe wo nlhatu aka miyaano, ila wo nlhatu ninyu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vanova phi ikatema yo uhukumulhiya ilhapo, vanova Nakare nholhelhi o ilhapo ilha noopikhulhiya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ni mii kennulhiyaka vachulhu ilhapo kinommwiiha kila ntu uwannyaka.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wo wulhumacha chiicho ahooniha naakhweke nookhwa ani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Paahi yoyo nlhoko uyo nkawaamwaakhulha, “Hiyaano ninoohimeriya ni Malhehero ihu wiira Kuristo khaawa aakhwa nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Nnooria chani etu wiira, Mwaana a Ntu nowiinulhiya? Yoyo Mwaana a Ntu uyo phi mpani?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nthuko bado urii ni inyu wo mahuku vakani. Mweeteke nnari ni yoyo nthuko uyo ipiphi ihuupatteni, ukhalhawaya aneeta mpiiphini khanochuwelha unokelha aya. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Paahi etu, ikatema nnari ni yoyo nthuko uyo nrumelhelheke nkhalhe attu o nthuko.”</para>
  <para style="p">Amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo, Yesu nkaarwa vaari utayi ni ayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhikhalha ni nrima wa attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Anakhalhaka Yesu ahopangacha cho ushangiha chonkhaye chiyo yoonaka, khayaanrumelhenlhe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu malhove yoolhumanche aya anamilhohi ashinna Isaya nkayatimira,</para>
  <para style="q">“Thithi, apani arumelhenlhe nttenga ihu?</para>
  <para style="q">Ni ikuru ya Athithi ichuwaneelhe wa apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Chiicho khayoonrie urumelhelha, ukhalhawaya ashinna Isaya yahoolhumacha tho wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Nlhuku hotiyelhelha miitho aya ahoone,</para>
  <para style="q">hophupuwalhiha mirima chaya,</para>
  <para style="q">ahoone wo miitho aya,</para>
  <para style="q">ahichuwelhe wo irusho chaya,</para>
  <para style="q">mena ahikirukunuwelhe, aneera Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q">wiira kaalhamihe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ashinna Isaya yoolhumanche yayo malhove ayo ukhalhawaya yahoona nthimicho wa Yesu, nkayaahimiacha mwaha wawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hata chiicho, aholhelhi enchi Ayahudi yahonrumelhelha Yesu. Nansho wo nlhatu ni Amafarisayo, khayolhumanche mwaha wo unrumelhenlha Yesu voonene, yaari yoovaka wiira anowoomolhiya nnupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yaathanana uthimichiya ni attu kuhiwe utotopelhiya ni Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhove na Yesu ninowaahukumulha attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru Yesu nkaawelhiha nlhove nkaahimia wiira, “Ntu nokirumelhelha, khanokirumelhelha mii tu, ila nowaarumelhelha ni ayo akirumme. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Attu anokoona miyaano anoowona akirumme. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Miyaano kiwiilhe velhaponi kikhalhe nthuko, attu onkhaye anokirumelhelha ahihalhe mwiipiphini. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ntu neewa malhove aka nansho wo uhivarelhelha, miyaano khakinonhukumulha, ukhalhawaya khakiwilhe uhukumulhani ilhapo nansho woopolhani attu o velhaponi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Attu ahinovarelhelha malhove aka ahana ntu mmoka owahukumulha. Nlhove nuulhumachilhe aka phinottuna waahukumulha nihuku no umalhelha! <verse number="49" style="v"/>Miyaano khakuulhumanche wo ikuru aka kimwanene, Athithi akilhehenre malheheriyo ayo phi kivanhe yo wulhumacha. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ni mii kinoochuwelha wiira malhehero aya anoowiha ukumi wo uhimalha. Paahi etu, miyaano kinohimiacha Athithi akilheehenre aya.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakhuchiha owiittucha awe mieto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Pasaka hinaphiya, Yesu ahochuwelha wiira isaa awe yo uthama velhaponi ni urwaa wa Athithi ihophiya. Ahaattuna chinene attu awe arii velhaponi, waattuna uhimmalha!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu ni owiittucha awe yaari anakhanlhe ulhia yolhia yo uchechilho. Nakare ahomalha unkelha Yuda mwaana a Nasimoni Isikariote, ni ummaha nrima wo unthumiha Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha wiira Athithi yahonvaha chittu chonkhaye mmathathani mwawe. Ni wiira aakhumme wa Nlhuku, ni vano nohokolhia wa Nlhuku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paahi ahothama vamezani nkeesha vathotho mwiinjiro awe, nkaakusha nchako nkeettuka nnyununi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yamalheke nkaahelha maashi munkhatoni, nkaachokholha waakhuchiha owiittucha awe mieto ni upoholha wo nchako weettunke awe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi nkaaphiyelha Nasimoni Peturo, nansho Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, inyuva nkikhuchihe mii mieto chaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khannochuwelha vano ittu kinopanga aka nansho nnochuwelha kaanyuma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayamwiirelha Yesu, “Inyuva khannokikhuchiha mieto mahuku onkhaye, ngu!” Yesu nkaakhulha,</para>
  <para style="p">“Kaahukuchihekeni mieto chinyu khannokhalha owiittucha aka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nkikuchiheke, kuhiwena mietoru, nansho ni miono chaka ni muru ni uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Ntu rampe khanothananiya ukhucha yaahikhalheke mieto, ukhalhawaya homalha iruttu awe yonkhaye ihorera. Mwaattiva nhohapihiya, nansho kanhiwe onkhaye.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ahonchuwelha ntu nottuna unthumiha, phi nlhatu no wiira, “Mwaattiva nhohapihiya, nansho kanhiwe onkhaye nri orera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Amalheke waakhuchiha mieto ni uwara tho mwiinjiro awe, ahokhalha vamezani, nkeerelha, “Chani, nhochuwelha yayo kuupangenlheakani ayo? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnokiihana Owiittuchiha ni Athithi, vavawo nhoolhumacha rata, ukhalhawaya phi mii. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi yakhalhaka miyaano kirii Athithi ni Owiittuchiha inyu kihookhuchihani mwaattiva mieto, ni mwaattiva chiicho nkhuchihaneke mieto mwaashineneru. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kihoovahani malhikaaniho, ni inyu mpangelhaneke chiicho thoko chupangenlheakani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, ipotta kirina ikuru yo umpwaha mwanene ntheko awe, mena akarumiya khanokhalha ni ikuru yulhupalhe waapwaha naaruma. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Paahi etu, yakhalhaka nnoochuwelha yayo, mwapangaka nnoopuha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Alha kinolhumachaka alha khaanowaachani mwaattiva onkhaye. Miyaano kinowaachuwelha alhe kaathanlhalhe aka. Nansho ihophwanelhiya utimire wo Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Ulhe lhilhie yolhia aka hokirukunuwelha kimwanene.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Miyaano kinouhimeriani ihinaya ukhumelhelha, vanottuna aya ukhumelhelha vawo mmwe mwaarumelhelha wiira ‘Miyaano Phi Yoyo.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, nompochera ntu kinonruma aka nokipochera mii, ni ntu nokipochera mii, naapochera akirumilhe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhohera wiira noothumihiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mako 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha, ahokelhiya ihuzuni chinene munrimani, nkeera wo uhivitha, “We ikekhiaye kinohimiechesha wiira mmoka inyu nookithumiha!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayawehana ashineneru, ashangaka chinene wo uhichuwelha wiira nohimiani. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Owiittucha mmoka, aattuniya ni Yesu chinene, ahokhalha wo umwaatameria Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayanthoonyera ni umwiirelha, “Mwaakoheke anaacha apani?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Owiittucha uyo nkaachushera ni umwaatameria chinene Yesu, nkankoha, “Thithi, phi apani?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu kinohalha aka ummaha nkatte kipamphe aka nnyiponi, phi yoyo.” Paahi, nkaakusha ikipande yo nkatte, nkaapapha nnyiponi, nkammaha Yuda mwaamwana a Nasimoni Isikariote. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda Isikariote amalheke upochera yeyo ikipande iyo, Nakare nkaakelha. Paahi Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Inothanana inyu upanga iyo pangakani wo uhipicha!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nansho khaawo anakhalhaka ntu mmoka aya aakhanlhe va yolhiani aachuwenlhe wo nlhatu waani eerelhiya chiicho. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Yuda aari ntu o ushunga nrupa wo nchurukhu, owiittucha akina nkayaanyihera wiira Yesu aari anrumaka arwee athume chaathananiya wo nihuku no Pasaka, ama wiira arwee aavahe amashikini. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Paahi Yuda amalheke ukusha ikipande yo nkatte ilhe, nkaakhuma vathe wo uhipicha. Yeyo yaari uhiyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malhehero o naanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuda athameke, Yesu nkeera, “Vano Mwaana a Ntu hothimichiya, ni uyo Nlhuku hothimichiya nhina mwawe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Thoko nthimicho wa Nlhuku chipatakulhiye aya nhina Mwaana a Ntu, ni uyo Nlhuku nowooniha nthimicho wo Mwaana a Ntu nhina mwawe mwanene, ni upanga chiicho wo uhipicha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Achishaana aka, khakinaya kirii ni inyu wo ikatema vakani tu. Nnookaavia, nansho vano kinouhimeriani alhe yaahimenrie aka aholhelhi Ayahudi, ‘Unokelha aka mii, mwaattiva khannooria urwaa!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kinouvahani malhehero o naanano, nttunaneke mwaashineneru, nttunaneke thoko chuuttunne akani mwaattiva. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwattunanaka mwaashineneru, attu onkhaye anoochuwelha wiira mwaattiva phi owiittucha aka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhohera wiira Napeturo anonkhota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakoha, “Thithi nnokelha vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Unokelha aka khannooria ukittwara vano, nansho nnookittwara kaanyuma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayaamwirelha, “Thithi, nlhatu waani kihoorie uuttwarani vanova? Kirii tayari ukumiha ukumi aka wo nlhatu winyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani nrii tayari ukumiha ukumi inyu wo nlhatu waka? Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani wiira, nthupi uhinaya wiipa nnowa mwaakikhota vararu mwiiraka khankichuwenlhe mii.”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu phi iphiro yo ukelha wa Athithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhichukulhe munrimani mwinyu. Munrumelhelheke Nlhuku, nkirumelhelheke ni mii. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uwani wa Athumwanaka mapuro ari menchi, ihikaari chiicho, kanouhimeriani. Vano mii kinokelha ukoroshelhani nipuro. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Karwaaka ni ukoroshelhani nipuro, kinoohokolhia uwa ukushani uwannyaka, ni inyu nkhalhe variaka miyaano. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ni inyu nhochuwelha iphiro yo urwaa wowo unokelha aka uwo.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Natomaso nkayankoha, “Thithi, khaninchuwelha unokelha inyu, ninohalha uchuwelha chani etu, yeyo iphiro iyo?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Miyaano phi iphiro, ikeekhene ni ukumi. Khaawo ntu nooria urwaa wa Athithi aahivireke uwannyaka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka nhokichuwelha miyaano, nnowaachuwelha ni Athumwanaka chiicho. Ni toka vano, nnowaachuwelha, tho nhomalha woona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nafilipo nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, nnooniheke Athithi, ni hii inonithosha.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Kihokhalha ni inyu mahuku onkhaye alha, ni inyu Nafilipo bado khannakichuwelha? Akoonne mii ahoona Athithi. Nnooria chani etu wiira, ‘Nnoonihe Athithi?’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chani Nafilipo khannorumelhelha wiira miyaano kinokhalha nhina Athithi, ni ayo Athithi anokhalha nhina mwaka? Akinoolhumacha malhove wo ikuru aka, Athithi arii nhina mwaka phi nopanga mitheko chaya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nhothananiya ukirumelhelha vaneera aka wiira miyaano kinokhalha nhina Athithi ni ayo Athithi anokhalha nhina mwaka. Ama etu, nrumelhelheke wo nlhatu no mitheko chinopanga aka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, anokirumelhelha mii anoopanga mitheko chinopanga aka miyaano, eiyo, anoopanga ata moolhupalhe chinene, ukhalhawaya kinokelha wa Athithi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ittu iriyoothe inottuna inyu ulhepelha wo nchina naka kinoopanga, wiira nthimicho wa Athithi wooniye nhina mwawe Mwaana a Ntu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwakilhepelhaka ittu iriyoothe wo nchina naka, kinouvahani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheera noonivaha Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mwakittunaka, nnoovara malhehero aka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kinowaalhepelha Athithi wiira ammwiihe Okaviha nkina, nohalha ukhalha ni inyu mwaattiva wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yoyo phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku nohalha upatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku. Attu o velhaponi khanowa ampochera ukhalhawaya khanowa aamwoona, mena unchuwelha. Nansho mwaattiva nnowa mwanchuwelha ukhalhawaya noowa aakhalha nhina mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Khakinoohiyani mwaattiva thoko ashaana ohiiya, kinoohokolhia tho uwaninyu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ihohalha vakani attu o velhaponi khanowa yaakona tho. Nansho mwaattiva nnookona, ukhalhawaya miyaano kinkumi, ni inyuva chiicho nnookhalha akumi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku nno vanohalha aya waaya nnoowa mwaachuwelha wiira miyaano kiri nhina mwa Athithi, ni inyuva nrii nhina mwaka, thoko ni mii kiriaka nhina mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ntu nopochera malhehero aka ni uvara, yoyo phi nokittuna. Ntu nokittuna miyaano noottuniya ni Athumwanaka, ni mii kinowaattuna ni wiichoniha uwannyaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nayuda, kahiwe Isikariote ulhe, nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, vanoorieke chani inyuva wiichooniha uwanihu hii, kuhiwe wa attu o velhaponi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu akittunaka, noovarelhelha malhove aka. Athumwanaka anonttuna, ni hii ninoowa neesha nipuro uwannyawe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ntu hinokittuna khanovarelhelha malhove aka. Nlhove niiwilhe inyu nno kanihiwe nawaka, nansho na Athithi akirumme.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha vano, kinari vamoka ni inyu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Okaviha, Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nottuna urumiya ni Athithi wo nchina naka uyo, noowittuchihani kila ittu ni uwupushani chittu chonkhaye chuuhimenrieakani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Mpuha phi nouhiyeraakani, kinouvahani mpuha aka. Akinoovahani thoko attu o velhaponi chineera aya. Nhikhelhiye nipampa munrimani, mena nhoove. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nheewa kuuhimeriakani, ‘Kinoorwaa, nansho kinoohokolhia tho uwaninyu.’ Yakaari mwahokittuna, mwanteelhiya woona wiira kinokelha wa Athithi, ukhalhawaya yayo phi olhupalhe ukipwaha mii. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kihoohimeriani malhove menchi ihinaya ukhumelhelha, vanohalha aya ukhumelhelha vawo mmwe mwaarumelhelha. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Khakinoolhumacha ni inyu tho mwaha mulhupalhe, ukhalhawaya nholhelhi o velhaponi, Nakare ri muuwani. Nansho uwannyaka miyaano kharina machiri, <verse number="31" style="v"/>nansho attu o velhaponi anoothananiya uchuwelha wiira kinowaattuna Athithi, phi nlhatu noopanga kila ittu thoko Athithi chikilheherilhe aya.</para>
  <para style="p">“Mweemelheke, nirweeke, nngwe nithame vaa.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu phi Nzabibu we Ikekheene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Miyaano phi nzabibu we ikeekhene, ni Athumwanaka phi namalhima. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila nritta nhina mwaka nihinemma maphepu nenno ninoothamihiya, kila nritta ninemma rata ninookhwacheriya nithepeke wimma. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nhokhalha orera wo nlhatu no meettuchiho kuwiittuchinheakani. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkhalheke nnalhutaanne ni mii, ni mii kikhalhe nhina mwinyu. Nritta khaninooria wimma vekha aya, naahilhutaaneke ni ntepo naya. Phi chiichammo etu ni inyu mwaattiva khannooria wimma izabibu mwaahilhutaaneke ni mii nhina mwaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Miyaano phi ntepo no zabibu, ni inyu mwaatti phi maritta. Nolhutaana ni mii, ni mii kalhutaanaka nhina mwawe, yoyo nowimma maphepu menchi, ukhalhawaya ntu hinokhalha ni mii khanooria upanga ittu iriyoothe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe ahilhutaaneke ni mii noorihelhiya vathe thoko nritta ninorihiya aya vachereshere nkanooma. Maritta thoko yayo anookhupiya ni urihelhiya vamooroni avie. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwakhalhaka nhina mwaka ni malhove aka akhalhaka nhina mwinyu, paahi etu, nlhepelheke ittu iriyoothe nnothanana inyu, nnoovahiya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nthimicho wa Athithi unowoonia mwemmaka maphepu menchi, vavawo etu phi noohalha inyu ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kinottunani mwaattiva thoko Athithi chikittunne aya mii, nhalheke nchuwelhaka wiira kinouttunani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwavaraka malhehero aka nnookhalha mu uttunani mwaka, thoko ni mii chivanre aka malhehero a Athumwanaka ni ukhalha mu uttunani mwaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha ikhalhe wiira uteelhiya waka ukhalhe nhina mwinyu, ni uteelhiya winyu utimire. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Malhehero aka phi alha, nttunaneke mwaashineneru, nttunaneke thoko chuuttunne akani mwaattiva. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Khuuwo uttuna wulhupalhe chinene umpwaha uttuna wo ntu nokumiha ukumi awe wo nlhatu no manyampwana awe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwaattiva nnookhalha manyampwana aka mwapangaka kinoolheherakani alha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Khakinowiihanani tho mwaatti akarumiya, ukhalhawaya karumiya khanochuwelha chinopanga aya anene ntheko anonruma. Nansho miyaano kinowiihanani mwaattiva manyampwana, ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani chonkhaye chiiwilhe aka wa Athumwanaka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kanhiwe mwaatti mwaakithanlhe miyaano, mii phi othanlheni, nkakoorumani nrwee mwemme maphepu menchi, maphepu anolhokelha. Athithi awe yoovahani ittu iriyoothe inaalhepelha inyu wo nchina naka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Paahi etu, malhehero aka uwaninyu phi alha, nttunaneke mwaashineneru.</para>
  <para style="s">Ichimwa ya attu o velhaponi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ichimwa ya attu o velhaponi yoophwanyakani mwaattiva, muupuwelheke wiira yahokiphwanya miyaano ihinaaya uuphwanyani mwaatti. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yakaari wiira nri attu o velhaponi, ilhapo yaanottunani mwaattiva thoko attu aya. Mwaattiva kanhiwe attu o velhaponi, nansho miyaano kihouthanlhani velhaponi va, wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu ilhapo inoupangelhani ichimwa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muupuwelhacheke yohimenrieakani wiira, ‘Ipotta khachirina ikuru umpwaha mwanene ntheko naaruma.’ Yakhalhaka ahokihuviha miyaano, anouhuvihani ni mwaattiva chiicho, yakhalhaka ahovara nlhove naka, anoovara ni nlhove ninyu chiicho. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo anowa opangelhani mwaattiva wo nlhatu wo urumelhelha nchina naka, ukhalhawaya khayaachuwenlhe akirumme. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yakaari khakaawilhe ni wulhumacha, yayo khayaakhalha ni milhatu, nansho vano kharina nlhove no wiivaraanga wiira khanawonya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Ntu nokipangelha ichimwa miyaano, nowaapangelha ichimwa ni Athumwanaka chiicho. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kihikaapannge uwannyaya mwaha uhinapacha upangiya ni ntu nkina khayaakhalha ni nlhatu wiira ahowonya. Nansho vano ahoona chipannge aka nkayaakipangelha ichimwa miyaano, nkayaapangelha ichimwa Athumwanaka chiicho. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi etu, malhove arii nhina Malhehero aya, ahophiyelha, ‘Ahokipangelha ichimwa wo uhikhalha nlhatu!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Vanohalha awe uwa Okaviha kinohalha aka unruma uwaninyu uyo, Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nowa aapatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, yoyo noowa aahimiechesha ikeekhene inokaacha mii. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaattiva chiicho, nnoowa mwaakihimiechesha ukhalhawaya nri vamoka ni mii ukhuma vaachokhonlhe aya.”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha tho “Kihouhimeriani yayo wiira nhihiye nrima nrina inyu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Attu anowoomolhani mwaattiva mmanupani mwaya mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. Eiyo tho, mahuku anoowa, kila ntu nothanana uwiivani mwaattiva naanyihereke wiira nonkaviha Nlhuku. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Attu anowa uupangelhani yoyo mwaha uyo ukhalhawaya khaachuwenlhe Athithi, mena khakichuwenlhe mii. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kihoohimeriani yayo ikatema yo upangia waya yaphiyaka, mmwe mwoopuwelha wiira kahowaamukani.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntheko wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">“Khakoohimenrieni ulha mwaha ulha toka khalhayi ukhalhawaya kaari vamoka ni inyu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nansho vano kinokelha wa ayo akirumme ayo, nansho khaawo inakhalhaka mmoka inyu nokikoha wiira nnokelha vayi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya vano kihouhimeriani yoyo mwaha uyo, ihuzuni ihoucharani mu nrimani mwinyu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani ikeekhene wiira, ihorera nambaya miyaano kirwee, ukhalhawaya kaahirweeke, Okaviha uyo khanowa uwaninyu. Paahi etu, karwaakaru, kinonruma uwaninyu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ni uyo vanottuna awe uwa, nowoopusha attu o velhaponi wiira irusho chaya chihowonya, ahottekelha ikekhia ni ihukumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ahowonya wo nlhatu wo hikirumelhelha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ahohiya mwaha wo uvara ikekhia, ni ukhalhawaya vano kinokelha wa Athithi, khannokoona tho. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ahotteka mwaha wo ihukumu ya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya nholhelhi o velhaponi va, Nakare homalha uhukumulhiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Kihanaa malhove menchi o uhimeriani, nansho vano, khannooria uvilhelha. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vanohalha aya uwa Iphumu ya upatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, nouchuwelhihani ikeekhene yonkhaye. Khanowa ahimiachaka wo ikuru awe mwanene, nansho noolhumacheke inohalha awe wiiwa ni uchuwelhihani chittu chinowa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yoyo naakithimicheke mii, ukhalhawaya nowa uuchuwelhihani chinohalha awe wiiwa uwannyaka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Chittu chonkhaye chirina aya Athithi phi chawaka, phi nlhatu no uhimia wiira Iphumu ya Nlhuku nouchuwelhihani chinohalha aka ummaha ovaheni.</para>
  <para style="s">Ihuzuni ni Mpuha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ihohalha ikatema vakani mwaatti khannokona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe akina nkayakohana ashineneru, “Ana nohimiani vanoniirelha awe, ‘Wo ikatema vakani khannokoona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona?’ Tho neera, ‘Ukhalhawaya kinokelha wa Athithi!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Rina maana ani vaneera awe, ‘Wo ikatema vakani?’ Khanichuwenlhe inoolhumacha awe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha wiira yaathanana unkoha, paahi etu nkeerelha, “Chani, woonaka nnookohana mwaashineneru mwaha kuulhumanche aka wiira, ‘Wo ikatema vakani khannokoona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona tho?’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, mwaattiva nnowunlha ni uwereiya munrimani, nansho ilhapo inootelhiya, nnookhalha ni ihuzuni nansho ihuzuni inyu inoorukunuwa ukhalha uteelhiya nrima. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ikatema opani ari munkurini vaneethaphulha aya anowoona uweria aya ukhalhawaya ikatema yo uweria ihophiya, nansho amalhaka wiithaphulha khaanoopuwelha tho uweria uwo nlhatu no uteelhiya wiira mwaana mwankani hoyaria velhaponi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Chiichammo phi ri aya uwaninyu mwaatti, vano nri mu wuunlhani, nansho kinowa koowoonani tho, ni mirima chinyu chinowa uteelhiya, uteelhiya uhinooria uthamihiya ni ntu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Nenno nihuku nno nawaaka, khannowa mwaakilhepelha ittu iriyoothe. Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, iriyoothe inottuna inyu waalhepelha Athithi wo nchina naka, anouvahani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mpaka nna khannavekelha ittu iriyoothe wo nchina naka. Nvekelheke nnoovahiya, ikhalhe wiira uteelhiya winyu utimire.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hooria ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kihoohimeriani yayo wo malhikaaniho. Nansho ikatema inoowa vahinowa aka wulhumacha wo malhikaaniho, nansho kinowa wulhumacha mwaari wo uhivitha mwaha unaacha Athithi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku nno nawaaka, nnowa mwaalhapelha Athithi wo nchina naka, kuuhimeriakani wiira akinowa kaalhepelha wo ulhepelhelhani mwaattiva, <verse number="27" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya Athithi anene anouttunani mwaattiva. Anouttunani ukhalhawaya mwaattiva nhokittuna mii ni urumelhelha wiira kikhumme wa Nlhuku. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Miyaano kaakhumme wa Athithi, nkakaawa velhaponi, uno vano kinoohiya ilhapo ni uhokolhia wa Athithi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paahi owiittucha awe nkayaamwiirelha, “Eiyo, vano nnoolhumacha wo uhivitha, nhuulhumachaka wo malhikaaniho. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vano nihochuwelha wiira inyuva nnoochuwelha kila ittu, ihooriaka uukohani tho ittu iriyoothe. Yeyo phi nonirumelhelhilha wiira nkhumme wa Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulhacha, “Chani, nnoorumelhelha vano? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ikatema inoowa, ni iyo ihomalha uphiya, mwaattiva onkhaye vanottuna inyu umwariaa kila ntu uwannyawe, ni mii kinoohiiya yeekha aka. Nansho miyaano khakirii yekhaaka, ukhalhawaya Athithi arii vamoka ni mii. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha wiira nkhalheke ni mpuha wo ulhutaana ni mii. Nnoowa mwaahuvihiya velhaponi, nansho mpisheke nrima! Miyaano kihokottolha ilhapo!”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhepelhelha owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkaaweha nchulhu wiirimu, nkeera, “Thithi, ikatema ihophiya! Munthimicheke Mwamwaninyu ni uyo Mwaana othimichekeni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mwahonvaha Mwamwaninyu ikuru wa attu onkhaye, wiira aavahe ukumi wo uhimalha attu onkhaye munvanhe inyu ayo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ni ukumi wo uhimalha unari wiira uuchuwelhani inyuva, nrii yeekha inyu Nlhuku e ikeekhene, ni unchuwelha Yesu Kuristo, munrumme inyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Miyaano kihoothimichani velhaponi vaa, kihomalhiha ntheko ukivanhe inyu kipange. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Thithi! Nkivaheke nthimicho vano, nthimicho kaarina aka ilhapo ihinaaya wuupiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Kihaachuwelhiha attu nchina ninyu, yayo nkivanhe inyu ukhuma velhaponi. Yaari attu awinyu, ni inyuva nkamwaakivaha. Ni ayo ahovara nlhove ninyu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ahochuwelha vano wiira kila ittu ikivanhe inyu ikhumme uwaninyu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Miyaano kihaavaha nttenga ukivanhe inyu, ni ayo ahopochera, ahochuwelha wiira wo ikekhiaye kikhumme uwaninyu, ni ayo anoorumelhelha wiira inyuva nhokiruma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Kinaalhapelhelha yayo, mena khakinaalhepelhelha attu o velhaponi, nansho kinaalhepelhelha attu akivanhe inyu, ukhalhawaya phiri awinyu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye arina aka phi awinyu, ni awinyu phi awaka, ni nthimicho waka uhoonia wa attu akivanhe inyu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vano kinoowa uwaninyu, kakihiwe tho ntu o velhaponi, nansho ayo arii velhaponi. Athithi atakatifu! Wo machiri o nchina ninyu nikivanhe inyu, chonte mwaashunge rata akhalhe ittu imoka thoko hiyaano chiri ihu amoka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vaari aka ni ayo, miyaano kahaashunga rata wo machiri o nchina ninyu nikivahilhe inyu. Miyaano kiheenanelha, mena khaawo anakhalhaka mmoka aya kinrinhe aka, aahikhalhe ulhe ntu nohalha upotera, wiira Malhove Matakatifu atimire. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi etu vano kinowa uwaninyu, ni mii kihoolhumacha ulha mwaha ulha velhaponi va, wiira attu yoorie ulhutaana ni mii muuteelhiyani waka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Miyaano kihaavaha nttenga inyu, ni attu o velhaponi nkayaapangelha ichimwa, ukhalhawaya yayo kaahiwe amoka aya attu o velhaponi, thoko ni mii kihiri aka ntu o velhaponi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Khakinolhapelha wiira mwaathamihe velhaponi, nansho kinolhapelha wiira mwenanelhe ni Nakare. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ayo kaahiwe o velhaponi, thoko ni mii kihiri aka o velhaponi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mwaathanlheke mwaanene wo ikeekhene, nlhove ninyu nikhalhaka phi ikeekhene. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Thoko chikirumme inyu velhaponi, ni mii chiicho kihaaruma ayo velhaponi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, miyaano kimwanene kinowithanlha kikhalhe isadaka uwaninyu ni ayo chiicho eeshiye isadaka wo ikeekhene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Khakinaalhapelhelha ayo vekha aya, nansho kinaalhepelhelha ni attu anohalha ukirumelhelha mii wo nlhatu no nttenga waya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kinolhapelha wiira onkhaye akhalhe ittu imoka. Thithi, kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe nhina mwihu thoko inyuva chiri inyu nhina mwaka ni mii nhina mwinyu. Kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe ittu imoka, ilhapo iwe yaarumelhelha wiira inyuva mwaahokiruma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Miyaano kihaavaha nthimicho yoolhe ukivanhe inyu, wiira akhalhe ittu imoka thoko ni hiyaano chiri ihu amoka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ilha ikhalhe wiira miyaano kikhalhe nhina mwaya, ni inyu Thithi nkhalhe nhina mwaka. Kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe ittu imoka, ilhapo ichuwelhe wiira inyuva mwaahokiruma, ni wiira, nnowaattuna ni ayo thoko chikittunne inyu mii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Thithi, kinothanana ayo akivanhe inyu ayo akhalhe vamoka ni mii varii aka, awe yoona nthimicho waka ukivanhe inyu. Ukhalhawaya mwahokittuna ilhapo ihinaya wuupiya. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Thithi orera nrima, attu o velhaponi khanoochuwelhani, nansho miyaano kinouchuwelhani. Alha ni ayo ahochuwelha wiira inyuva mwahokiruma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kihaahimeria nchina ninyu, ni mii kinoothepa wiira chiicho, uttuna urina inyu uwannyaka uwe waakhalha nhina mwaya, ni mii kikhalhe nhina mwaya.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noovariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke wulhumacha, nkaarwa ukhopelhelhe wo nshepa wo Keduroni, vamoka ni owiittucha awe. Vavawo vakittu vawo vaari ni imata yo miri cho mizeituni, Yesu nkaakelha mommo vamoka ni owiittucha awe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yuda Isikariote, anthuminhe Yesu, ahochuwelha vaari aya, ukhalhawaya mikwaha chinchi Yesu aari akumaanaka ni owiittucha awe wowo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu, Yuda nkaarwa attukanaka mphingo wa manyaasikari ni attu olhitelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku aarumiye ni Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo, nkaawana umatani uwo anaweelhe ikerero, ikhandiri, ni mithuko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu, aari achuwelhaka chonkhaye chinohalha umphwanya, nkaachusherera, nkaakoha, “Nnaavia apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nkayaamwakhulha, “Yesu o Unazareti!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeerelha, “Phi miyaano.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yuda, onthumiha Yesu aari neemenlhe vavawo vamoka ni ayo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu eereke, “Phi miyaano,” nkayaahokolhia utulhi, nkayaawulhuwa vathi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha tho, “Nnaavia apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwakhulha, “Yesu o Unazareti!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha “Kihomalha uhimeriani wiira miyaano phi uyo. Paahi etu, yakhalhaka nnokaavia mii, mwahiyacheke akina alha arwaacheke.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>olhumanche yayo wiira atimire malhove yeera “Attu aakivahilhe inyu Thithi khakinrinhe anakhalhaka mmoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo, nkayaatholholha mwaalho mulhupalhe waarina aya, nkayanthikilha nnyaru no wiimonono namitheko a Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe. Karumiya uyo eehaniya Maliki. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha Napeturo, “Nhokolhoshe mwaalho inyu nnigonerani mwaya. Chani, nnothanana kihiwurerie ikikombe yo ntwarusho ikivahilhe aya Athithi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorwehiya wa Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mphingo wa manyaasikari a Arumi ni mulhupalhe aya, ni akarumiya a Ayahudi, olhitelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku nkayammara Yesu, nkayanttuka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkayanrweeha wa Anasi, aari ahokohi aya Nakayafa opochera ishaani olhupalhe o yeyo iyaakha iyo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yayo Nakayafa ayo phi alhe olhumanche nlhove no weerelha Ayahudi wiira nambaya ntu mmoka akhwe wo nlhatu no attu enchi.</para>
  <para style="s">Napeturo anonkhota Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mako 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo vamoka ni owiittucha nkina yahonttwara Yesu. Yoyo owiittucha nkina uyo aari achuwelhiyaka ni Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, paahi etu nkaakelha vamoka ni Yesu upuwani waya Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nansho Napeturo yaari aneemenlhe vathe, vaatameria nlhako. Paahi etu, owiittucha nkina aachuwelhiya ni Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ayo, ahokhuma vathe nkanvekelha mwalhi namitheko o uhulha nlhako wiira aawiihe Napeturo mpaani. Nkaawiiha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yoyo mwalhi namitheko o uhulha nlhako uyo nkaakoha Napeturo, “Chani, ni inyuva kanhiwe mmoka aya owiittucha awe ulha ntu ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">Napeturo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Akihiwe miyaano!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Anamitheko ni manyaasikari yaari anaparihenlhe mooro wo makhalha ukhalhawaya yaari nlhaalha wo uririya, nkayaarukureria yoottaka mooro ashinene. Napeturo nkayaarwaa ni ayo yootte mooro.</para>
  <para style="s">Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe anonkohakoha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayankohakoha Yesu mwaha wo owiittucha awe ni meettuchiho awe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwakhulha, “Ikatema chonkhaye kaari kuulhumachaka ni attu voonene, meettuchiho aka kiituchihaka mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni wi Inupa yuulhupalhe ya Nlhuku, vakittu vanokumana aya Ayahudi onkhaye. Khakinapacha mena wiittuchiha iriyoothe wo uvitha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nlhatu waani vano nnokikoha miyaano? Mwaakoheke alhe yeewilhe koolhumanche aka. Yayo phi chuwenlhe kaahimenrie aka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Amalheke wulhumacha yayo, namitheko olhita mmoka emenlhe vavawo nkaamwata nikofi Yesu eeraka, “Chani, nenno phi nlhove nowaakhulha Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Yakhalhaka kuulhumanche pufia, nkahimiecheshani kittenke vayi, nansho yakhalhaka kihoolhumacha rata, woonaka nnookaata?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Anasi nkayanrweeha Yesu uno nattukiye, wa Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe Nakayafa.</para>
  <para style="s">Napeturo anonkhota Yesu tho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mako 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Napeturo yaari vavawo yoottaka mooro. Attu nkayaakoha, “Chani, ni inyuva kanhena owiittucha awe amoka?”</para>
  <para style="p">Napeturo nkayaakhota eeraka, “Kakihena miyaano!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Karumiya aya Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe mmoka, nlhoko awe ntu aakhapiye nnyaru ni Napeturo, nkaakoha, “Chani, miyaano khakowonneni inyuva umatani vamoka ni uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayakhota tho “Akihiwe mii.” Vavawo nthupi nkaweepa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorweehiya upuwani u Napilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Paahi etu, nkayankusha Yesu u Nakayafa, nkayanrweha upuwani wa amwene o Uyudea. Yeyo yaari mapikoosha, ni ayo wiira ahoochelhe unlhia Pasaka, khayaakenlhe mpaani ahiwe ahinanarihiye. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wo chiichammo etu, Napilato nkayaakhuma vathe, nkayeera, “Nrina milhatu chaani ni ulha ntu ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nkayaakhulha, “Thoko ulha akaari khanatteka khanammwiiha uwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Napilato nkayeerelha, “Munkusheke etu mwaattiva mwaashinene, nrweeke mwanhukumulheke wo ulhikaana ni Malhehero inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ayahudi nkayaakhulha, “Hiyaano nihochiichihiya umwiiva ntu riyoothe.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yaapangelhe chiicho wiira atimire malhove yoolhumanche awe Yesu ulhohera naakhweke nookhwa ani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaarwaa upuwani tho, nkayaamwiihana Yesu ni unkoha, “Eti inyuva phi Mwene Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, yayo malhove ayo anokhuma mmuruni mwinyu ama attu akina phi uhimenrieni mwaha aka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaakhulha, “Chani, ki Nyahudi mii? Attu o velhaponi winyu ni attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe phi uwinheni uwannyaka. Nttekilheni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Umwene aka kuhiwe wo velhaponi va. Umwene aka wakaari wo velhaponi va, anamitheko aka aanokinkelha kihivariye ni Ayahudi. Mena, umwene aka kuhiwe wo velhaponi vaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vavawo Napilato nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Paahi etu, inyuva Amwene?” Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyuva nhohimia wiira miyaano Mwene. Miyaano kiyareelhe wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo kihowa velhaponi uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha we ikeekhene. Kila ntu novara ikeekhene nookiwelhelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaakoha, “Ikeekhene phi ishiyani?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohukumulhiya wiiviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mako 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Napilato yamalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkayaakhuma tho vathe waari aya Ayahudi, nkayeerelha, “Miyaano khakinoona nlhatu uriyoothe wiira ulha ntu ulha hotteka. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mwaatti nhanaa malhemalhelho o uttukulhelhani ntu mmoka vanophiya aya ikatema yo Pasaka, paahi etu, nnoothanana vano kuuttukulhelheni Mwene Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vavawo nkayakhuwelhacha yiiraka, “Mena! Kahena ulha hii ninonthanana Baraba!” Yoyo Baraba uyo aari ntu o uvara makhuche.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paahi, Napilato nkaalhehera wiira Yesu aatiye ikopo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Manyaasikari nkayaavilhika mphumburu wo miiwa, nkayammwariha mmuruni, nkayammwariha mwiinjiro wo irangi yo zambarau. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkayaawa ni unveehacha yiiraka, “Moyoo, Amwene Ayahudi!” Nkayaamwata makofi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Napilato nkayakhuma tho vathe, nkayeera, “Nkoonani, kinommwiiha vano uwaninyu, nchuwelheke wiira miyaano khakoonne nlhatu uriyoothe uwannyawe.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paahi, Yesu nkaakhumihiya vathe nawanre mphumburu wo miiwa ni mwiinjiro we imwene. Napilato nkayeerelha, “Mmweheke! Ntu mwanene uyo phi ulha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni anamitheko olhita Inupa ya Nlhuku vaamwonne aya nkayakhuwelha yiiraka, “Akomelhelhiye vansalaabani! Akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p">Napilato nkayeerelha, “Munkusheke etu vano mwaattiva mwaashinene, mwamwiiveke. Ukhalhawaya miyaano khakoonne nlhatu uriyoothe wiira hotteka.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha, “Hiyaano nihanaa Malhehero, ineera wiira hophwanelhiya ukhwa, ukhalhawaya heepanga Mwaana a Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Napilato yeeweke yayo malhove ayo, nkayaathepa woova. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nkayaakelha tho mpaani, nkayankoha Yesu, “Inyuva nkhume vayi?” Nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaamwirelha, “Woonaka khannottuna wulhumacha ni mii? Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira mii kihanaa ikuru yo uhiyererani ni ikuru yo ukhomelhelhani vansalaabani?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khamwaakhalha ni ikuru iriyoothe vachulhu waka mwahakaavahiye ukhuma wiirimu. Paahi etu, ntu kiwinhe uwaninyu uyo yoyo ri o uwonya chinene.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukhuma vavawo, Napilato nkayaavia iphiro yo unhiyerera, nansho Ayahudi nkayaanyakulha yiiraka, “Mwanhiyereraka ulha ntu ulha, inyuva kanhiwe anlhoko aya Akaisari o Urumi, kila ntu neepanga ukhalha mwene nowaathunalhiha Akaisari o Urumi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paahi, Napilato veewilhe aya yayo malhove ayo nkayammwiiha Yesu vathe, nkayakhalhelha ihiche yo waahukumulhelha attu, vakittu vaneehaniya we Iebraniya Gabatha maana aya “Mmuto wo Malhuku.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Waari uthana, nihuku no wiicheesha rata wo nihuku no Pasaka. Napilato nkayeerelha Ayahudi, “Mummweheke, Mwene inyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Attu nkayaakhuwelha, “Munthamihe! Munthamihe! Mwankhomelhelhe vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p">Napilato nkayaakoha, “Chani, kinkhomelhelheke Mwene inyu vansalaabani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayaakhulha, “Hiyaano khanirina mwene nkina ahikhalhe Akaisari o Urumi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vavawo, Napilato nkayankumiha Yesu nkaavaha ammwie anrweehe akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhomelhelhiya vansalaabani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Paahi etu, nkayankusha Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ni uyo nkaakumihiya nakunshe nsalaaba awe arweehiyaka vakittu vaneehaniya we Iebraniya Gologota, maana aya Nikhurukucha no Muru. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vavawo phi vakittu vaakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu. Aakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni attu akina elhi, mmoka wiimonono ni nkina wiimushi wawe. Yesu aari variyari. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaalhepa nlhove vakibaoni ni ukhomelhelha vachulhu nsalaaba. Nlhove naalhepiye nno neera, “Yesu o Unazareti, Mwene a Ayahudi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ayahudi enchi yahoshoma nenno nlhove nno, ukhalhawaya vaakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu vawo, vaari vakiviru ni vawani. Ni nlhove nno naari ninalhepiye wo moolhumo e Iebraniya, Ilatini, ni Iyunani. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayeerelha Napilato, “Nhilhepe wiira, ‘Mwene a Ayahudi,’ nansho nlhepeke, ‘Ntu enre, Miyaano phi Mwene a Ayahudi.’ ” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Napilato nkayaakhulha, “Kilhempe aka, kiholhepa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Manyaasikari yamalheke unkhomelhelha Yesu vansalaabani, nkayaawia ikuwo chawe, nkayaakawa vacheshe, kila nsikari nifungu nimoka. Nkayaakusha chiicho ni mwiinjiro awe nkina, waari wo ttaviya ikuwo imoka yaalhutanne, wo hitottiya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Paahi etu, manyaaasikari nkayeewanana ashineneru wiira, “Ilha nihaahulhe, noopeke ikhura yo ulhamulha inaakhalheke ya apani.” Yoyo mwaha uyo waapangia atimire Malhove Matakatifu aneera</para>
  <para style="q">“Yahokawana ikuwo chaka,</para>
  <para style="q">ni mwiinjiro aka wahoopelhiya ikhura.”</para>
  <para style="m">Paahi etu, phi chiicho chapannge aya manyaasikari ayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vaatameria nsalaaba waakhomelhelhiye Yesu yaari aneemenlhe anumwanawe, ni arokoraya anumwanawe, ni Amariamu ahanu a Nakileopa, ni Amariamu Magidalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkoona anumwanawe, ni owiittucha anttunne awe aneemenlhe, nkeerelha anumwanawe, “Amma! Mummweheke, vano ulha phi mwamwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tho nkaamwirelha owiittucha ulhe, “Mwaaweheke, alha phi anumwaninyu vano.” Uchokholhelha vavawo, yoyo owiittucha uyo nkaakusha Amariamu nkaakhalhana uwannyawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkoona wiira onkhaye ahotimira, ni wo utimiriha Malhove Matakatifu nkeera, “Kinoona nttona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vavawo yahokhalha ni ikahi yaachanre idivai yo uhichasha. Paahi, nkayaruwia mdodoki mu divaini mmo, nkayaattuka munthalheni, nkayaamweshera vamalhakuni. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu amalheke utoolha idivai iyo, nkeera, “Mitheko chihotimira!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yamalheke nkooroma muru, nkaahiya nrima.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohomiya nivaka vapararini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Paahi aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayaavekelha Napilato wiira oonthe mieto cha attu aakhomelhelhiye, ni ukurusha mitembo chaya vansalaabani. Yaari avekelhaka ukhalhawaya yaari nihuku no ijumaa, nihuku no wiicheesha rata. Wo chiicho, iruttu chihihalhe mmisalaabani Nihuku no Wiittuwa, ukhalhawaya nenno nihuku nno naari nulhupalhe chinene. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Paahi etu, manyaasikari nkayaarwaa, nkayamuntha mieto ntu aakhomelhelhiye wiiminono, ni nkina o wiimushi, attu yaakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni Yesu alhe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nansho yamphiyelheke Yesu, nkayoona wiira homalha ukhwa, wo chiichammo etu khayoonthe mieto chawe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nsikari mmoka nkanhoma nivaka Yesu vapararini, wo uhipicha nkayaakhuma iphome ni maashi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ni uyo onne chechiyo ahoonechesha inyu mwaatti nrumelhelhe. Ni malhove yuulhumanche awe phi ikeekhene, ni uyo hochuwelha wiira uhimiechesha wawe phi ikeekhene. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yoyo mwaha uyo waapangelhe Malhove Matakatifu atimire, “Khaniwo nikhuva nawe inakhalhaka nimoka ninohalha wunthiya.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tho Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Anommweha ulhe anhomilhe aya nivaka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noovithiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Umalha waya yayo, Nayusufu, anenchi o Uarimathaya, yahaavekelha Napilato nipesha no ukusha iruttu ya Yesu. Nayusufu yaari owiittucha a Yesu, nansho wo wiivitha, ukhalhawaya yaanoova aholhelhi a Ayahudi. Paahi, Napilato nkayaahiyera. Nayusufu nkayarwaa, nkayakurusha iruttu ya Yesu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nayusufu, yaarweelhe vamoka ni Nanikodemo yaathonke mahuku o utulhi ayo unrweelha Yesu uhiyu. Aawiilhe anakunshe manemane aathakanihiye ni ubani wo umalhaka iratili imia imoka o wootiha ntembo wa Yesu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Attu elhi ayo etu, nkayakusha iruttu ya Yesu, nkayaavilhikelha ikuwo yo uvithelha vamoka ni makhura ulhikaana ni malhemalhelho a Ayahudi o uvithaniya. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vavawo vakittu vakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu vawo vaari ni imata, ni mommo mmatani mmo mwaari ni nihiye no naanano nihinavithiya ntu riyoothe nhina mwaya. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya naari nihuku ni Ayahudi no wiicheesha rata wo Nihuku no Wiittuwa, ni ukhalhawaya nihiye nno naari vakhiviru, nkayeesha iruttu ya Yesu mwommo.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu hohihimmwa nnookhwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mapikoosha o nihuku no Jumaapili, Amariamu Magidalena yahorwaa unihiyeni, nkayoona wiira nlhuku naakhuneelhiye nihothamihiya vanlhakoni vo nihiye vawo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkayaarwaa attimakachaka urwaa wa Nasimoni Peturo ni owiittucha nkina attuniye ni Yesu, nkayeerelha, “Ahaathamiha Athithi nnihiyeni, ni hii khanichuwenlhe weeshiye aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Napeturo vamoka ni owiittucha nkina uyo nkayarwaa unihiyeni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Onkhaye oyelhi aari attawaka nansho owiittucha nkina uyo ahottawa chinene waapwaha Napeturo, nkaaholhelha uphiya unihiyeni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nkooroma ni uthurumelha, nkoona ikuwo yo uvithelha inavilhikachiye, nansho khaakenlhe nhina. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo ni ayo nkayaawa anttwaraka, nkaakelha nnihiyeni, mommo nkayoona ikuwo yaavithelhiye Yesu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ni ikitambaa yaakhunelhiye awe Yesu mmuruni ilhe. Yeyo ikitambaa iyo khayaari vamoka ni ikuwo iyo, nansho yaari inavilhikiye umuruni, thoko chaari aya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yamalheke owiittucha nkina aaholhenlhe uphiya unihiyeni uyo, nkaakelha ni uyo nhina. Nkoona, nkarumelhelha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaari ahinaya uchuwelha Malhove Matakatifu yeenre wiira noohihimmwa ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Paahi etu owiittucha ayo nkayaahokolhiacha uwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha Amariamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mako 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Amariamu yaari aneemenlhe vathe vo nihiye, onlhaka. Uno anari onlhaka, nkayooroma ni uthurumelha nnihiyeni, <verse number="12" style="v"/>nkayoona minepa elhi aawanre ikuwo chootelha ttuuu, anakhanlhe vaathalhelhiye aya iruttu ya Yesu, mmoka umuruni nkina umietoni. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Minepa nkachaakoha Amariamu, “Maanyi, nnonlhani?” Amariamu nkayaakhulha, “Ahaakusha Athithi aka, ni mii akichuwenlhe weeshiye aya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Amalhiheke wulhumacha yayo, nkaarukunuwa utulhi, nkayamwoona Yesu neemenlhe vavawo, nansho khayanchuwelhe wiira aari phi Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Maanyi, nnonlhani? Nnaavia apani?” Amariamu, yaanyiheraka wiira yoyo ntu uyo aari mwanene imata, nkayaakhulha, “Munna, yakhalhaka phi inyuva mwathaminhe, nkihimerie mwenshe vayi, ni mii kinorwaa waakusha.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Khu Amariamu!” Ni ayo Amariamu nkayarukunuwa, nkayoolhumacha wo Iebraniya, “Raboni.” Maana aya akhalhaka, “Owiittuchiha.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachiichiha eeraka, “Nhikivare, khakinarwaa kaye uchulhu wa Athithi. Nansho nrweeke wa ashilhoko mwaahimerieke wiira, kinokelha nchulhu wa Athumwanaka arii Athumwanaya, Nlhuku aka ri Nlhuku aya.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi etu Amariamu Magidalena nkayaarwaa ni waahimeria owiittucha alhe wiira, “Kihoona Athithi!” Ni waahimeria malhove aahimenrie aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yaari uchechilho yo nenno nihuku no Jumaapili nno, owiittucha yaari anathukumanne vamoka mpaani milhako chaari chinatteiye, nlhatu no woova aholhelhi a Yahudi. Paahi Yesu nkaakhumelhelha ni weemelha variyari aya, nkeerelha, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Amalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkooniha miono chawe ni niparari nawe. Owiittucha nkayaatelhiya chinene woona Athithi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha tho, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu! Thoko Athithi chikirumme aya, ni mii kinourumani mwaattiva.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Amalhiheke, nkaawuchelhelha ni weerelha, “Mumpochereke Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwaahiyereraka attu uwonya waya, anoohiyereriya, mwaahahiyerereke, khaanohiyereriya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Natomaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Natomaso amoka aya khumi ni elhi alhe aneehaniya Nivata, khayaatamme ikatema Yesu vaawilhe awe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi etu, owiittucha akina akhunanaya ayo nkayeera, “Nihoona Athithi!” Natomaso nkayeera, “Kaahoneke marottelha o ikhomo mmathathani mwawe ni ukelhiha nikokho naka mmarottelhani mmo, ni uhelha moono aka mpararini mwawe, khakirumelhelhaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yavireke mahuku mathanu ni mararu owiittucha ayo yaari anathukumanne tho vamoka mpaani, Natomaso ahaatama na ayo. Milhako chaari chinatteiye, nansho Yesu nkaakelha, nkeemelha variyari aya, nkeera, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Amalhiheke nkeerelha Natomaso, “Mmwiiheke nikokho ninyu vaa, mmweheke ni miono chaka, mmwiiheke moono inyu uyo nkelhiheke mpararini mwaka. Nhiyeke ulhipa nrima uwo, nrumelhelheke!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Natomaso nkayaakhulha, “Athithi ni Nlhuku aka!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani, nnorumelhelha ukhalhawaya nhookoona? Ahoreeriya yayo anorumelhelha, nansho wo hikoona mii!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nnikwa uri nkitabuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu ahopanga cho ushangiha chikina chinchi vaari awe na owiittucha awe chihilhepiye nhina ilha ikitabu ilha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nansho chilha chilhepiye mwaatti nrumelhelhe wiira Yesu phi Kuristo Moopolhi, Mwaana a Nlhuku, ni wo urumelhelha winyu mpatte ukhalha ni ukumi wo ikuru yo nchina nawe.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowakhumelhelha owiittucha athanu ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umalhawaya, Yesu nkaakhumelhelha tho owiittucha awe vachereshere nttiya no Utiberiya. Aakhumelhenlhe choo <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo ni Natomaso aneehaniya Nivata, ni Nanathanieli anenchi o Ukaana yo Ugalilaya, ni ashaana elhi a Nazebedayo ni owiittucha awe akina elhi, yaari onkhaye vamoka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayeerelha akhunanaya, “Kinokelha uvarani ihopa.” Ni ayo nkayaamwiirelha, “Ni hii ninoorwaa vamoka ni inyu.” Nkayaarwaa nkalhavani, nansho yoyo uhiyu uyo khayaapantte ittu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nchuwa vaakhuma aya, Yesu nkeemelha vachereshere nttiya, nansho owiittucha awe khayaachuwenlhe wiira aari phi Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkaakohacha, “Mwaatti, khannapatta ihopa ngati?” Ni ayo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Eiyo khaninapatta ittu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Ntikhelheke ittavi mpantta wo wiimonono wo ikalhava ni inyu nnoovara ihopa.” Paahi etu, nkayaatikhelha ittavi nansho khayoonrie upurulha, ukhalhawaya ihopa chaavanre aya chahothepa winchiva. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Owiittucha aattuniye ni Yesu ulhe nkeerelha Napeturo, “Athithi!” Napeturo yeeweke wiira aari Athithi, nkayettuka mwiinjiro aya ukhalhawaya aari aneekokotenre, nkayaathuphelha mmaashini. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho owiittucha akina nkayaawa uchengweni nkalhavani uno apurulhaka nttavi naachanre ihopa, khawaari utayi, yaari woomalhaka ihatua imia imoka vaneemelha maashi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaphiyeke vachengweni nkayoonacha ihopa chinaaneelhiye vamakhalhani ni nkatte. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Mmwiiheke vaa vakani ihopa chimennje inyu chiyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo nkayaawelha nkalhavani, nkayaapurulhelha nttavi vachengweni ninachanre ihopa chulhupalhe imia imoka makhumi nthanu ni taru. Inakhalhaka chiicho, nttavi khanaapaphuwilhe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Mmwaacheke vaa etu mmwe mwaalhia.” Khaawo anakhalha owiittucha mmoka onrie unkoha, “Inyuva phi apani?” Ukhalhawaya yahochuwelha wiira yaari Athithi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawa, nkaakusha nkatte, nkaavaha, nkaapanga chiichammo ni ihopa chilhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ulha, waari nkwaha wo neraru Yesu waakhumelhelha owiittucha awe, ukhuma vaahihimmwe awe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowareriha ni Napeturo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yamalhiheke ulhia, Yesu nkaakoha Nasimoni Peturo, “Nasimoni, mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnookittuna mii waapwaha alha akina alha?” Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, Thithi, nnochuwelha wiira miyaano kinouttunani.” Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ashaana o ikhondoro chaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nkeerelha tho ninayelhi, “Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnokittuna?”</para>
  <para style="p">Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, Thithi, nnoochuwelha wiira kinouttunani.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ikhondoro chaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkaakoha yo neraru, “Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnokittuna?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vavawo Napeturo nkayaachukulha wo nlhatu nookohiya wo neraru, “Nnokittuna?” Nkayaakhulha yiiraka, “Thithi, inyuva nhochuwelha chonkhaye, inyuva nnoochuwelha wiira miyaano kinouttunani.” Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ikhondoro chaka! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, vaari inyu amirawo mwaholhemalhelha wiittuka nchako ni ukelha uriwoothe waathanana inyu. Nansho vanohalha inyu wuulhuvalha, nnowookolha miono chinyu, ni ntu nkina nouttukani ni urweehani uhinothanana inyu urwaa.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wo wulhumacha chiicho, ahooniha iphiro yaani Napeturo anohalha aya uvira muukhwani ni unthimicha Nlhuku. Amalhiheke nkeerelha, “Nkittware.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni owiittucha nkina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vavawo Napeturo nkayarukunuwa, nkayaamwona owiittucha aattuniye ni Yesu ulhe, noottwara. Ulha phi owiittucha aakhanlhe amwaatameriaka chinene Yesu ikatema yaalhiaya yolhia yo uchechilho, ni unkoha “Thithi phi apani anohalha uthumihani?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Napeturo vaamwonne aya yoyo attwaraka, nkayankoha Yesu, “Thithi ni alha mwaha aya uri chani?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Yakhalhaka wiira kinothanana alha ahalheke mpaka vanohalha aka uwa tho, irini uwaninyu? Inyu nkittwareke mii!” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Paahi etu, yoyo mwaha uyo nkawawanelha munlhokoni mwa attu anttwara na owiittucha awe wiira yoyo owiittucha uyo kanokhwa. Nansho Yesu khenre wiira yoyo owiittucha uyo khankhwa, nansho enre “Yakhalhaka wiira kinothanana alha ahalhe mpaka vanottuna aka uwa, irini uwaninyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ulha phi owiittucha nohimiechesha ni ulhepa ulha mwaha ulha. Ni hii ninoochuwelha wiira himianche awe iri ye ikekhiaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Chihawo chittu chikina chinchi chaapangilhe awe Yesu, yakaari chaholhepiya chonkhaye, imoka kaanyuma yo ikina, kinaanyihera wiira ilhapo khayooria ukhalha ichitabu chikaalhepiye chiyo.</para>
</usx>
